<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MRK" style="id">Engungwel</book>
  <para style="h">MAAK</para>
  <para style="toc1">Nsia yi Ngesɛ yi ékel Maak</para>
  <para style="toc2">Maak</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mak</para>
  <para style="mt2">Nsia yi Ngesɛ yi ékel</para>
  <para style="mt1">Maak</para>
  <para style="imt">Obɛɛn b'ɔ̃nkaan</para>
  <para style="ip">Ɔ̃swɛn-ɔ̃nkaan wu eli Maak. Ndɛ tsɔɔn ákesal ye ntam Pool (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 12:25">Ɛ̃sa 12.25</ref></char>) ŋ'ɛ̃kwel ye k'esal ndɛ ye ntam Piɛɛl onge ɔ̃swɛn ɛ̃nkaan (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1PE 5:13">1Pi 5.13</ref></char>). Oyɔ, mboo yi ébɔɔ Maak ãndɔɔ mã nkiin m'ekel ndɛ Nsia yi Ngesɛ yi. Onse yɔ eli y'endɔ-ndɔɔ bvi esuo kwɛn Maak áswɛn ãndɔɔ m'ébɔɔ ndɛ ola mbuul wu áli mwɛn a mɔ̃.</para>
  <para style="ip">Anga-ãyal bibi b'ayio Ɔ̃nkaan a Nziã abetsam kwɛn Maak ákel ɔ̃nkaan wu sua mvel wu ãnku-ãsɛɛn ye tyel (63) ye wu ãnku-ãsɛɛn ye mpuɔɔ̃ (68) ke bviil li Lom. Maak oswɛn ɔ̃nkaan wu ol'akiool bɛn k'Ayuda wɛ. Me ndɔɔ yi awuaal a bɔ, ndɛ okaal ãndɔɔ m'ákel m'onywã wu Ebele ye wu Alameyɛ̃ m'onywã wa Ngelek, bvool obɛɛl bɔ onkɔɔ b'Ayuda.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ndɔɔ yi epio Maak ɔ̃liɛɛn ŋã, ɛ̃sal ɛ̃ Yeso: oboo b'anga-ãluu, osa kwɛn amampa alɔɔ me ndɔɔ yi aliil ɔ̃bobɔ a baal. Emvieel e Yeso bvi eyɛɛn Maak me ndɔɔ a bvɛ onse ɔ̃kaan wu enduru kuun ye mpuɔɔ̃.</para>
  <para style="ip">Emvieel o bvɛ esuo onziã o Yeso, onge b'esuo Maak bia-byɛ bɛɛn ɔ̃luo wu ɛ̃kwel wa sɔɔ li ɛ̃kwel kwɛn Yeso oli «Muaan a Nziã» (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MRK 1:1">1.1</ref></char>). Sua ntɔ a ɔ̃nkaan, mfam a ambwel-mbwel ɔ̃nkam (100) wa Lom, ke nkwel enkulusu, oyɛɛn ndiri: «Ngwanyã, mbuul wu áli Muaan a Nziã!» (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MRK 15:39">15.39</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Akoo k'akab ɔ̃nkaan wu m'ebaal bviaal bvi ela bvi ela: Onse ebaal ki ɛ̃kwel, Maak asuo kwɛn m'emfa ki ékekal Yeso, ndɛ ákewal ɔ̃yɛɛl wu epfu e ndɛ. Nsa bibi Yeso áyɛɛn me ndɔɔ ãmpal m'eyemwɛn ndɛ tiil epfu e ndɛ ke Yelusalem (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MRK 1-13">1–13</ref></char>). Onse ebaal ki bviaal (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MRK 14-16">14–16</ref></char>), Maak asuo kwɛn epfu olɔ eli Nsia yi Ngesɛ, ke ngwel wɛ me nkuul a lɔ Yeso ŋ'asi ndɔɔ yi élieel ɔ̃liaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn Edzayi (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 53:12">Edz 53.12</ref></char>). Ke ngwel wɛ, Yeso oyi me ndɔɔ yi «awa elaã e ndɛ onge ɔ̃bvɛn wu afuru, me ndɔɔ yi abvuul ɔ̃bɔbɔ a baal» (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MRK 10:45">10.45</ref></char>). Maak hɛ̃ osuo kwɛn Yeso ásiool onge b'élieel ndyam. Muaan a Nziã ále k'akoo k'akal ɔ̃bu onse mpiɛɛn wɛ!</para>
  <para style="ip">K'osɛɛl b'ɔ̃nkaan, Maak asuo kwɛn ke mbee a osiool o Yeso, ndɛ osuo nzuru ol'akaal (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MRK 16:7-8">16.7-8</ref></char>), bvool ol'ayio, bu alieel bɔ ãndɔɔ m'asa (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MRK 16:9-20">16.9-20</ref></char>).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MRK 1" />
  <para style="s1">Ãtee ã Dzaã Batis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 1:1" />Obɛɛn o Nsia yi Ngesɛ yi Yeso Mãsia, wu Muaan a Nziã, <verse eid="MRK 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 1:2" />onge b'ákel onse ɔ̃nkaan wu Edzayi wu ɔ̃liaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã ndiri: «Tal, mɛ̃ ngyuɔɔl ntam a mɛ̃ ke nkwel a yɛ, me ndɔɔ yi ayɛɛl yɛ nkuul. <verse eid="MRK 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 1:3" />Ndɛ wu mbuul wu abebiool nkal ɔ̃baan wa kɛɛ-kɛɛ ndiri:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:3">“Efaal ɔ̃siɔɔn me ndɔɔ a Mfam Nziã!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:3">Eseel ãnkuul ã ndɛ ãkal dzu!”»<verse eid="MRK 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 1:4" />Dzaã wu ákewa baal opongo onse ɔ̃baan wa kɛɛ-kɛɛ áyi. Ndɛ áketa baal ãmbel k'awal opongo b'okaal b'ɛ̃kwal kwɛn bɔ abɔɔ odzeel b'ãbi. <verse eid="MRK 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 1:5" />Baal bueel ba nsie yi Yude ye ba bviil li Yelusalem ákeya ola ndɛ. Bɔ ákekiool ãbi ã bɔ ke nkwel a baal bueel, obobɔ Dzaã ákewa bɔ opongo onse nzal yi Dzolodɛ̃. <verse eid="MRK 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 1:6" />Dzaã akélaal ekɔ ki me mfu e nyam wu ɔ̃mbiri-ãpfuũ wu ata me swamo, y'ɔ̃sii wa kwiil me luu. Bvi-odza bvi ndɛ éli ɛ̃nyɛɛ̃ ye mbaal ã nzoo. <verse eid="MRK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 1:7" />Ndɛ áketsal nsia ndiri: «Mbuul wu onduru mɛ̃ waan àyeya ke mbee a mɛ̃. Kɛn a mɛ̃ ndyam ke mvaan k'emfɔɔn me ndɔɔ yi enyiɔɔn ɛ̃sii mi asimpal a ndɛ wɛ. <verse eid="MRK 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 1:8" />Mɛ̃, mɛ̃ ngwi byɛ opongo b'ãdza, kɛn a ndɛ, ndɛ àwa byɛ opongo b'Ɔ̃fel wu Ɔ̃nsensal.»<verse eid="MRK 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Opongo y'ɔ̃mbio a Yeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 1:9" />Onse ãtsoo omɔ̃, Yeso ofi Nadzalet ke nsie yi Ngalile, bu ayi. Dzaã bu awi ndɛ opongo onse nzal yi Dzolodɛ̃. <verse eid="MRK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 1:10" />Ŋ'eyii epal Yeso onse ãdza, ndɛ omwɛn ywel eyɛɛl nzuru bvool Ɔ̃fel osool nkal a ndɛ m'emfa ki kuun. <verse eid="MRK 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 1:11" />Nkii ngamɔ̃ bu eyɛɛn fa ywel ndiri: «Yɛ Muaan a mɛ̃ wu ɔ̃tio li, me ndɔɔ a yɛ, mɛ̃ ndi y'esɛ!» <verse eid="MRK 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 1:12" />Alili oŋɔ̃, Ɔ̃fel obiri Yeso onse ɔ̃baan wa kɛɛ-kɛɛ. <verse eid="MRK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 1:13" />Ndɛ okal onse ɔ̃baan wa kɛɛ-kɛɛ ãtsoo ãku-ãnã, bvool Satana ombio ndɛ. Ndɛ ákekal y'anyam b'edzwa, bvool ãnzwel ãkesal me ndɔɔ a ndɛ.<verse eid="MRK 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ayio anã b'ɛ̃kwel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 1:14" />Ke mbee a ŋ'asiin Dzaã, Yeso oyɛn Ngalile. Ndɛ áketsal Nsia yi Ngesɛ yi Nziã okɔ, ndiri: <verse eid="MRK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 1:15" />«Lio emeekoo bvool Okwɛn o Nziã omoosyal tsotsoo. Ekaal ɛ̃kwal ɛ̃ byɛ bvool ekiool Nsia yi Ngesɛ!»<verse eid="MRK 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 1:16" />Tsoo ngelemɔ̃, Yeso ákebwel nku-a-nku a baã li Ngalile, ndɛ omwɛn Simɔ̃ y'Ãndele wu muaan-ngoo a ndɛ wu Simɔ̃. Bɔ áketyal ãkii ã bɔ onse baã, nzal-a-ŋɛn bɔ áli aswal b'answi. <verse eid="MRK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 1:17" />Yeso olieel bɔ bubu: «Enɔɔn a mɛ̃, obobɔ mɛ̃ èsuul byɛ ekal aswal a baal!» <verse eid="MRK 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 1:18" />Kɛn alili oŋɔ̃, bɔ ayiri ãkii ã bɔ, bu anɔɔn a Yeso. <verse eid="MRK 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 1:19" />Ŋ'esyel Yeso ãnku-nkwel, ndɛ omwɛn baan a Dzebede, Dzak ye Dzaã wu muaan-ngoo a ndɛ. Bɔ áli onse ebɛɛ e bɔ, bvool ákefaal ãkii. <verse eid="MRK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 1:20" />Alili oŋɔ̃, ndɛ oti bɔ mbel. Bɔ asiil tal a bɔ Dzebede onse ebɛɛ y'asal, bu anɔɔn a Yeso.<verse eid="MRK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mbuul wa y'ɔ̃fel wu ɔ̃bi-ɔ̃bi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 1:21" />Yeso y'ayio a ndɛ ayɛn bviil li Kapelenawum. Me tsoo li saba, ndɛ osam onse nzɔ a ãbuɛɛn a Ayuda, bu abvi oyiool. <verse eid="MRK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 1:22" />B'ákeyoo ndɛ ákekam bibi m'ãtee ã ndɛ, ke ngwel wɛ ndɛ ákeyiool y'okwɛn bueel, k'onge ayiool b'ãngel wɛ. <verse eid="MRK 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 1:23" />Ŋ'esa oŋɔ̃, onse nzɔ a bɔ yi ãbuɛɛn, éli ye mbuul ngɔmɔ̃ wu áli y'ɔ̃fel wu ɔ̃bi-ɔ̃bi. Ɔ̃fel ondɛ obiool ndiri: <verse eid="MRK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 1:24" />«Yeso wa Nadzalet, yɛ ye bee ndɔɔ mã? Yɛ bee yi obweel? Mɛ̃ ngyɛɛ ngesɛ wɛn yɛ nã li: yɛ li mbuul wu Ɔ̃nsensal wu eyuɔɔl Nziã.» <verse eid="MRK 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 1:25" />Yeso bu ayɛɛn ndɛ bam kokɔ ndiri: «Kuru onywã a yɛ bvool pal onse mbuul wu!» <verse eid="MRK 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 1:26" />Ɔ̃fel wu ɔ̃bi-ɔ̃bi bu onziool mbuul ondɛ me nsie bvool bu apal onse ndɛ m'okuaal b'ɔ̃sɔɔl wa kokɔ. <verse eid="MRK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 1:27" />Baal bueel ongɛɛ obɔɔ, bu abvi bam-a-bam ofuul ndiri: «Yi ndɔɔ mã? Mã mpii ãtee m'ãnyiɔɔn mã y'okwɛn mam! Ndɛ ayɛɛn ɛ̃fel mi ɛ̃bi-ɛ̃bi y'omfam bueel, myɛ̃ hɛ̃ ɛ̃lweel ndɛ!» <verse eid="MRK 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 1:28" />Obobɔ, kɛn alili oŋɔ̃, nsia a Yeso etsɔɔn m'etswi e nsie kieel ki Ngalile.<verse eid="MRK 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso oboo anga-ãluu bibi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 1:29" />Ŋ'epal Yeso onse nzɔ a ãbuɛɛn a Ayuda, ndɛ ye Dzak, ye Dzaã, ayɛn nzɔ a Simɔ̃ bwɛn a Ãndele. <verse eid="MRK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 1:30" />Ŋ'esa oŋɔ̃, okɔ o Simɔ̃ wu ɔ̃kaal áli bɔ, me ndɔɔ yɛn ndɛ áli ye baa. Alili oŋɔ̃, awi Yeso nsia a ndɛ. <verse eid="MRK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 1:31" />Yeso osyel tsotsoo a ndɛ, osiin ndɛ me kuɔɔl, bu atɛɛl ndɛ. Ndɛ baa bu efi, bvool bu awi bɔ bvi-odza.<verse eid="MRK 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 1:32" />Ŋ'etɔ ãnkunkwal, ŋ'edziin tal, ayi Yeso ye baal bueel b'áli y'ãluu ye b'áli y'ɛ̃fel mi bi-ɛ̃bi. <verse eid="MRK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 1:33" />Baal a bviil lam lueel aluul ke nkwel ɔ̃nywã a nzɔ. <verse eid="MRK 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 1:34" />Obobɔ, Yeso oboo baal bibi ba y'ãluu m'emfa bwɛn emfa, bvool otswɛɛl ɛ̃fel mi ɛ̃bi-ɛ̃bi boo-boo. Ndɛ k'awi myɛ̃ nkuul yi ɛ̃yɛɛn wɛ, ke ngwel wɛ myɛ̃ ɛ̃yɛɛ kwɛn ndɛ nã ali.<verse eid="MRK 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso oyɛn onse Ngalile wueel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 1:35" />M'epal-epal, ŋɛn epeel ale kɛn efi wɛ, Yeso otɛɛn, opal onkwel-a-nzi, bu ayɛn ɔ̃baan wa kɛɛ-kɛɛ. Okɔ, ndɛ obvi obuɛɛn. <verse eid="MRK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 1:36" />Simɔ̃ ye b'áli ye ndɛ abvi ndɛ obii. <verse eid="MRK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 1:37" />Ŋ'emwɛn bɔ ndɛ, bɔ alieel ndɛ bubu: «Baal bueel abebii yɛ.» <verse eid="MRK 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 1:38" />Ndɛ bu abveel bɔ ndiri: «Etswɛ eyi mboo nkyam, k'ãla mã nku-a-nku. Okɔ hɛ̃, ebvaan kwɛn mɛ̃ etsal Nsia yi Ngesɛ. Ke ngwel wɛ, obɔ otsɛn be ngwi mɛ̃ me nsie.» <verse eid="MRK 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 1:39" />Obobɔ, ndɛ oyɛn onse Ngalile wueel m'otsal o Nsia yi Ngesɛ onse ãnzɔ m'ãbuɛɛn m'Ayuda, bvool m'otswɛɛl b'ɛ̃fel mi ɛ̃bi-ɛ̃bi.<verse eid="MRK 1:39" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Obvuul o mbuul wa y'ãluu mã leba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 1:40" />M'emfa okyɛ, mbuul wa y'ãluu mã leba oyi tsotsoo a Yeso, obvi ãbuo ke nkwel a ndɛ, bu aluɔɔn ndɛ bubu: «Okɛɛn yɛ dzii, yɛ koo k'asuul mɛ̃ tsɛtsɛ.» <verse eid="MRK 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 1:41" />Yeso nyiĩ a ndɛ ebɔɔ yam bibi, onaan kuɔɔl, onywɛn a ndɛ, bu alieel ndɛ bubu: «Mɛ̃ nzii, oŋɔ̃ kal tsɛtsɛ!» <verse eid="MRK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 1:42" />Kɛn alili oŋɔ̃, ndɛ leba efi, bu ayii tsɛtsɛ. <verse eid="MRK 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 1:43" />Yeso bu awi ndɛ ãnkunkwa mam kokɔ bvool oyɔɔl ndɛ oyɛn y'ãyɛɛn m'onywã ndiri: <verse eid="MRK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 1:44" />«Oyɛɛ ke liaal mbuul ndɔɔ wɛ, kɛn a yɛ àyesuo nzuru ola ngaa-a-Nziã bvool àwa kab li etam Ngel a Moyize owa, me ndɔɔ otsiɛɛn o yɛ. M'emfa okyɛ, baal bueel àtsweel kwɛn yɛ tsiɛɛn.» <verse eid="MRK 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 1:45" />Kɛn a ŋ'eyɛn mbuul ondɛ, ndɛ obvi nsia oyɔ otsal me baal bueel, yɔ bu etsɔɔn ãmboo mbueel. M'emfa okyɛ, Yeso k'abekoo k'asam kal-a-kal onse bviil si ngemɔ̃ wɛ. Ndɛ oyii okal me pyɛ, k'ɔ̃baan wa kɛɛ-kɛɛ. Baal ákefa m'ãmboo m'ãmboo, ákeya ola ndɛ.<verse eid="MRK 1:45" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MRK 2" />
  <para style="s1">Obvuul b'ekal ke Kapelenahum</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 2:1" />Ke mbee ãtsoo ke kwɛ, Yeso oyebvool Kapelenahum. Baal ayoo ndiri ndɛ oli ke nzɔ. <verse eid="MRK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 2:2" />Embuul e baal ebvɔɔn m'emfa kyɛn ãmboo ãfi, onkyam okwel-a-nzi ke nkwel ɔ̃nywã a nzɔ. Obobɔ, Yeso otee bɔ Endɔɔ e Nziã. <verse eid="MRK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 2:3" />Ayiaal ndɛ ekal, ki ébiri baal anã. <verse eid="MRK 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 2:4" />Onge bɛn bɔ k'akoo k'atɔ ye ndɛ tiil ke mboo yi éli Yeso wɛ me ndɔɔ embuul, bɔ ayɛɛl sɛɛ e nzɔ ke ywel a mboo yi éli ndɛ, bu aswɛɛl ntal a abieel yi éli mbuul ondɛ bɔ. <verse eid="MRK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 2:5" />Ŋ'emwɛn Yeso okiool o bɔ, ndɛ olieel ekal ndiri: «Muaan a mɛ̃, adzeel ãbi ã yɛ.» <verse eid="MRK 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 2:6" />Ŋ'esa oŋɔ̃, ayiool b'ãngel ke kwɛ áli me tsɛn oŋɔ̃, bɔ abvi bam-a-bam otsam ndiri: <verse eid="MRK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 2:7" />«Otsɛn omã b'eyɛɛn ndɛ obobɔ? Ndɛ asiaan Nziã! Mbuul nã wu adzeel ãbi ã baal, okɛɛn ke kɛn a Niã ndyam wɛ?» <verse eid="MRK 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 2:8" />Alili oŋɔ̃, Yeso m'ɔ̃fel, otaal ãtsam ã bɔ, ndɛ bu alieel bɔ bubu: «Otsɛn omã b'etsam byɛ obobɔ? <verse eid="MRK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 2:9" />Ayɛɛn ndiri: “Adzeel ãbi ã yɛ”, oyɔ k'eli ndɔɔ yi mpal m'oyɛɛn wɛ, kɛn ayɛɛn ndiri: “Tɛɛn, wal ntal a yɛ, bvool yi”, oyɔ ndɔɔ yi enduru mpal m'oyɛɛn! <verse eid="MRK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 2:10" />Kɛn a mɛ̃ nzii kwɛn byɛ eyɛɛ bubu: Muaan a Mbuul oli y'okwɛn b'adzeel ãbi ã baal me nsie!» Ndɛ bu alieel ekal ndiri: <verse eid="MRK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 2:11" />«Mɛ̃ eliaal yɛ wɛn, tɛɛn, wal ntal a yɛ bvool kɔɔl nzɔ!» <verse eid="MRK 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 2:12" />Enki-anka oŋɔ̃, mbuul ondɛ otɛɛn, owel ntal a ndɛ, bu apal ke nkwel a baal bam bueel. Baal bueel ongɛɛ obɔɔ, bu abvi Nziã olweel ndiri: «Bee mwɛn-éndɛɛl kɛn emwɛn ndɔɔ yi bubu wɛ!»<verse eid="MRK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso oti Lebvi mbel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 2:13" />Yeso opal bvool, bu ayɛn nku-a-nku ãdza m'ɔ̃ngwa. Embuul e baal ékeya ola ndɛ, obobɔ ndɛ ákeyiool bɔ. <verse eid="MRK 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 2:14" />Ŋ'ékebwel ndɛ, ndɛ omwɛn Lebvi wu muaan a Alefe me nsɛn ke mboo yi afuru mpal. Yeso olieel ndɛ ndiri: «Nɔɔn a mɛ̃!» Ndɛ otɛɛn, bu anɔɔn a Yeso.<verse eid="MRK 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 2:15" />Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, onge bɛn Yeso oyedza ke nzɔ a Lebvi, atwal mpal bibi ye baal b'ãbi ayedza ye ndɛ bwɛn ayio a ndɛ, ke ngwel wɛ bɔ obɔ b'ákenɔɔn a ndɛ bibi. <verse eid="MRK 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 2:16" />Kɛn ayiool b'ãgel ba nkel yi afalisaye ayemwɛn kwɛn Yeso abedza y'atwal mpal ye baal b'ãbi, bɔ afuul ayio a ndɛ bubu: «Otsɛn omã b'ebedza ɔ̃tee a byɛ y'atwal mpal ye baal b'ãbi?» <verse eid="MRK 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 2:17" />Onge bɛn Yeso oyoo k'eyɛɛn bɔ, ndɛ olieel bɔ ndiri: «Baal ba kɛɛ-kɛɛ k'ali ye kɔɔ li ɔ̃boo wɛ, b'ali ye kɔɔ e ndɛ kɛn anga-ãluu. Mɛ̃ ke ngyi baal ba dzu mbel ota wɛ, beyenta mɛ̃ mbel kɛn anga-ãbi.»<verse eid="MRK 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso y'ãbuɛɛn mã me nzal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 2:18" />Tsoo ngelemɔ̃, ayio a Dzaã y'Afelisaye ákesa ãbuɛɛn mã me nzal. Bɔ ayebɔɔ Yeso, bu afuul ndɛ ndiri: «Ndɔɔ mã yɛn ayio a Dzaã y'Afalisaye abesa ãbuɛɛn mã me nzal, kɛn a ba yɛ k'asa mɔ̃ wɛ?» <verse eid="MRK 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 2:19" />Yeso obveel bɔ bubu: «Andoo b'ɔ̃baal ol'asi ãbuɛɛn mã me dzal ŋ'eli ɔ̃baal kɛn ye bɔ? Bɔ k'akoo m'osa mɔ̃ wɛ, nzal-a-ŋɛn ɔ̃baal oli kɛn ye bɔ. <verse eid="MRK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 2:20" />Kɛn ãtsoo ãkieel ãya mɛn àmbaal ɔ̃baal onse bɔ, obobɔ bɔ àsa ãbuɛɛn mã me nzal m'ãtsoo omɔ̃. <verse eid="MRK 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 2:21" />Mbuul k'akoo m'olɔ epio ki ekɔ ki enyiɔɔn m'ekɔ ki emeeyiil wɛ, ndɛ asa obobɔ, epio ki ekɔ ki enyiɔɔn ol'ekɔɔl ki emeeyiil, bvool bwel b'énduru li tsɔɔn m'okuun. <verse eid="MRK 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 2:22" />Mbuul k'alɔ mbal m'alili onse ãmfel mã m'ãmaãyiil wɛ, ndɛ asa obobɔ, mbal m'alili ol'ãmbwel ãmfel, oŋɔ̃ ndɛ bu abɛɛl ntaal me kiil. Mbal m'alili, alɔ mɔ̃ m'ãmfel m'alili!»<verse eid="MRK 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso ye tsoo e Saba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 2:23" />Tsoo ngelemɔ̃ li saba, onge bɛn Yeso ákebwel onse ãnguun a nsia e bele, ayio a ndɛ abvi nsia oka me nkuul-a-nkuul. <verse eid="MRK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 2:24" />Afalisaye bu alieel ndɛ ndiri: «Ndɔɔ emã bɔ asa ndɔɔ yi aluo osa me tsoo li saba?» <verse eid="MRK 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 2:25" />Ndɛ obveel bɔ bubu: «Byɛ lɔɔ-okal kɛn etsiɔ m'ési David, ŋ'ékaan ndɛ bvool áli me nzal, ndɛ ye b'áli ye ndɛ wɛ? <verse eid="MRK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 2:26" />David mpii ásam onse Nzɔ a Nziã, me lio li éli Abyataal ngaa-a-Nziã wu ɔ̃nɛn. Ndɛ ádzi amampa b'áwi Nziã ãkab bvool áwi hɛ̃ b'áli ye ndɛ. Kwɛn ŋɛn, b'áwi nkuul yi adza amampa obɔ éli kɛn angaa-a-Nziã!» <verse eid="MRK 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 2:27" />Yeso olweel bubu: «Nziã ási tsoo e saba me ndɔɔ a mbuul, ke ndɛ ási mbuul me ndɔɔ a tsoo e saba wɛ. <verse eid="MRK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 2:28" />Obɔ otsɛn bɛn Muaan a mbuul oli hɛ̃ mfam a tsoo e saba.»<verse eid="MRK 2:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MRK 3" />
  <para style="s1">Mbuul wu ékwi kuɔɔl</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 3:1" />Yeso bvool osam onse nzɔ ãbuɛɛn a Ayuda. Mbuul wu ékwi kuɔɔl áli onse oŋɔ̃. <verse eid="MRK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 3:2" />Afalisaye ákekyab Yeso me ndɔɔ yi atal owɛɛl ndɛ oboo mbuul ondɛ me tsoo e saba, kwɛn bɔ abɔɔ elyal ki afɛn ndɛ. <verse eid="MRK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 3:3" />Obobɔ, Yeso olieel mbuul wu ékwi kuɔɔl ondɛ ndiri: «Tɛɛn, ya mpɛ̃-a-mpɛ̃ a baal ŋã!» <verse eid="MRK 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 3:4" />Yeso bu alieel bɔ bubu: «Ki awi nkuul yi asa me tsoo e saba emã? Osa b'obvɛ wuo osa b'obi, obvuul o mbuul wuo obam o ndɛ?» Kɛn a bɔ awuun apipi. <verse eid="MRK 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 3:5" />Yeso oseel mviil otal bɔ ye mpuru, oyoo ãwua me ndɔɔ ɔ̃kwal mpɛn a bɔ. Ndɛ bu alieel mbuul ondɛ ndiri: «Naan kuɔɔl e yɛ!» Ndɛ onaan kyɛ, kyɛ bu esiool. <verse eid="MRK 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 3:6" />Afalisaye apal onse nzɔ a abuɛɛn oŋɔ̃, abvɔɔn ye baal b'Elode Ãtipas me ndɔɔ yi abii ãyal m'abam Yeso.<verse eid="MRK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Embuul e baal eyi ola Yeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 3:7" />Yeso y'ayio a ndɛ ayɛn sua baã li Ngalile. Embuul e baal enɔɔn a ndɛ, bɔ ákefa etswi e nsie ki Ngalile, ki Yude, <verse eid="MRK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 3:8" />bviil li Yelusalem, ákefa etswi e nsie ki Idume, ki Telasidzuudani, nkua-nku a Tiil ye Sidɔ̃. Bɔ ákeya ola ndɛ, me ndɔɔ yɛn bɔ ákeyoo nsia ãndɔɔ m'ékesa ndɛ. <verse eid="MRK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 3:9" />Obobɔ, ndɛ olieel ayio a ndɛ ndiri: «Eyɛɛl mɛ̃ ebɛɛ, me ndɔɔ yɛn embuul ki ebee m'oywɛn.» <verse eid="MRK 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 3:10" />Ke ngwel wɛ, onge bɛn ndɛ ákeboo baal bibi, bueel b'áli y'ãluu ákeya ola ndɛ, me ndɔɔ yi anywɛn me ndɛ. <verse eid="MRK 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 3:11" />Ŋ'ékemwɛn baal b'áli y'ɛ̃fel mi ɛ̃bi-ɛ̃bi Yeso, bɔ ákeya ãbuo obva ke nkwel a ndɛ bvool ákebiool ndiri: «Yɛ, yɛ Muaan a Nziã li!» <verse eid="MRK 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 3:12" />Kɛn a ndɛ ákeyiaan bɔ bam ndiri abee me ndɔɔ a ndɛ oyɛɛn.<verse eid="MRK 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso osueel antam kuun ye buaal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 3:13" />Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, Yeso oyɛn nkal a nkio, bu ati baal b'éli ndɛ ye kɔɔ e bɔ mbel, bɔ bu ayi ola ndɛ. <verse eid="MRK 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 3:14" />Ndɛ osueel baal kuun ye buaal b'eloo ndɛ m'atam, me ndɔɔ yɛn bɔ akal ye ndɛ bvool ndɛ ayuɔɔl bɔ k'ayetsal Nsia a Okwɛn o Nziã, <verse eid="MRK 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 3:15" />bvool k'atswɛɛl ɛ̃fel mi ɛ̃bi-ɛ̃bi ye waan lueel. <verse eid="MRK 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 3:16" />Ndɛ osueel bɔ kuun ye buaal ba: Simɔ̃ wu eloo ndɛ me Piɛɛl, <verse eid="MRK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 3:17" />ye Dzak wu muaan a Dzebede, ye Dzaã wu muaan-ngoo a ndɛ wu Dzak, b'éloo Yeso me Bohanangɛs, ŋ'ayɛɛn ndiri: «Baan a nzyel», <verse eid="MRK 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 3:18" />y'Ãndele, ye Filipe, ye Baatelemi, ye Matie, ye Toma, ye Dzak wu muaan a Alefe, ye Tade, ye Simɔ̃ wa nkel yi Adzelot, <verse eid="MRK 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 3:19" />ye Yuda Isikaliote, ndɛ ondɛ wu átiɔ Yeso.<verse eid="MRK 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eburu e Yeso edzii k'ebiri ndɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 3:20" />Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, Yeso oyebvool nzɔ. Embuul e baal ebvɔɔn bvool m'emfa kyɛn Yeso y'ayio k'abɔɔ mpwee yi adza yam wɛ. <verse eid="MRK 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 3:21" />Ŋ'eyoo eburu e Yeso nsia, bɔ alɔ mviil me nkuul me ndɔɔ yi ayesiin ndɛ, ke ngwel wɛ, bɔ ákeyɛɛn ndiri: «Ndɛ oyii y'owool.»<verse eid="MRK 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso ye Beledzebul</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 3:22" />Ayiool b'ãngel b'áfi Yelusalem ákeyɛɛn ndiri: «Beledzebul wu Ɔ̃pfu oli onse ndɛ!» Bvool ndiri: «Ndɛ ɛ̃fel mi ɛ̃bi-ɛ̃bi, me waan li Ɔ̃pfu wu mfam a ɛ̃fel mi ɛ̃bi-ɛ̃bi abetswɛɛl!» <verse eid="MRK 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 3:23" />Yeso oti bɔ mbel, bu ati bɔ mboo bubu: «Ebɛɛn bwɛn a bwɛn kwɛn Satana atswɛɛl Satana? <verse eid="MRK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 3:24" />Okɛɛn baal b'okwɛn ngɔmɔ̃ abvi odzwaan bam-a-bam, okwɛn obɔ òtsɔɔn. <verse eid="MRK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 3:25" />Okɛɛn baal a yam ngemɔ̃ abvi odzwaan bam-a-bam, yam olɔ ètsɔɔn. <verse eid="MRK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 3:26" />Okɛɛn Satana obvi odzwaan ye nzuru a ndyam, okɛɛn ndɛ okab nzuru, ndɛ k'abeyiil wɛ, okwɛn o ndɛ oŋɔ̃ ŋ'ɔ̃fi.»<verse eid="MRK 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 3:27" />«Ke ngwel wɛ, mbuul m'osam onse nzɔ a nga-mpɛn, bvool aturu opfel o ndɛ, obvie kɛn ndɛ osiin nga-mpɛn ondɛ, akuru ndɛ ɛ̃siil. Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, ndɛ fiabekwaal ndɛ nzɔ yueel. <verse eid="MRK 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 3:28" />Taa-taa bam, mɛ̃ eyɛɛn byɛ wɛn baal akieel abɔ odzeel me ndɔɔ ãbi ã bɔ mam mbueel y'osiaan b'esiaan bɔ Nziã. <verse eid="MRK 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 3:29" />Kɛn a mbuul ɔ̃bi pyɛ wu asiaan Ɔ̃fel wu Ɔ̃nsensal k'akoo bam m'obɔɔ odzeel wɛ, ndɛ àbiri pfuũ li obi obɔ ɔ̃bu.»<verse eid="MRK 3:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 3:30" />Yeso olieel bɔ obobɔ, me ndɔɔ yɛn bɔ ákeliaal ndiri: «Ndɛ oli y'ɔ̃fel wu ɔ̃bi-ɔ̃bi.»<verse eid="MRK 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eburu e Yeso bvi taa-taa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 3:31" />Ngoo ye baan-ngoo a Yeso atɔ. Bɔ atɛɛn onkwɛl-a- nzi, bu atam ndɛ mbel ota. <verse eid="MRK 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 3:32" />Embuul e baal ebvi nsɛn, edzii ndɛ. Bɔ alieel ndɛ ndiri: «Ngoo a yɛ, baan-ngoo y'ankyel a yɛ ali ke nkwɛl-a-nzi, bɔ abebii yɛ.» <verse eid="MRK 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 3:33" />Ndɛ obveel bɔ bubu: «Ngoo a mɛ̃ ye baan-ngoo a mɛ̃ eli anã?» <verse eid="MRK 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 3:34" />Ndɛ ayeseel mviil nkal b'abvi nsɛn adzii ndɛ, b'alieel bubu: «Ta ngoo a mɛ̃ ye baan-ngoo a mɛ̃ bɔ ba! <verse eid="MRK 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 3:35" />Ke ngwel wɛ, mbuul ɔ̃bi pyɛ wu asa b'edzii Nziã, ndɛ ondɛ wu oli muaan-ngoo a mɛ̃, nkyel a mɛ̃, ngoo a mɛ̃.»<verse eid="MRK 3:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MRK 4" />
  <para style="s1">Mboo a ɔ̃kwɛn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 4:1" />Yeso obvi oyiool bvool nku-a-nku a baã li Ngalile. Embuul e baal ebvɔɔn nku-a-nku a ndɛ. Obɔ otsɛn bɛn ndɛ oyebva nsɛn onse ebɛɛ ki éli nkal a baã. Embuul e baal bueel éli me nsie tsotsoo ãdza. <verse eid="MRK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 4:2" />Ndɛ ákeyiool bɔ ãndɔɔ bibi m'ãmboo. Tal m'ékeyiool ndɛ bɔ: <verse eid="MRK 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 4:3" />«Eyoo! Tsoo ngelemɔ̃, ɔ̃kwɛn ngɔmɔ̃ oyekwɛn nsia. <verse eid="MRK 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 4:4" />Me lio li ékeyiri ndɛ nsia, yinkyɛ ebvi nku-a-nku a nkuul. Anywɛn bu adzi yɔ. <verse eid="MRK 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 4:5" />Nsia yinkyɛ ebvi ke mboo yi y'ãnkɔɔn, yɛn nsie bibi pyɛ. Yɔ emɛn yam tswa-a-tswa, me ndɔɔ yɛn nsie k'éli ye dzio wɛ. <verse eid="MRK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 4:6" />Kɛn ŋ'epal tal, ekwɛn obvɛ edzio, bu ekɛɛ, ke ngwel wɛ bvɛ k'élɔ ɛ̃dza wɛ. <verse eid="MRK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 4:7" />Nsia yinkyɛ ebvi onse ɛ̃ti mi ãnsiɛɛn, ɛ̃ti mi ãtsiɛɛn ɛ̃mɛn, bu ɛ̃foo ekwɛn obvɛ, obobɔ bvɛ k'eburu nsia wɛ. <verse eid="MRK 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 4:8" />Kɛn a nsia yinkyɛ ebvi onse nsie yi mvɛ-mvɛ. Yɔ emɛn, eyel tiil bu eburu: ekwɛn kyɛn eburu nsia ãku-ãtyel, kyɛn eburu nsia ãku-ãsɛɛn, kikyɛ bvool eburu nsia ɔ̃nkam.» <verse eid="MRK 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 4:9" />Yeso bvool olweel ndiri: «Yɔɔl kwɛn wa y'ãnswi m'ayoo, ayoo!»<verse eid="MRK 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Otsɛn b'ebeyɛɛn Yeso m'ãmboo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 4:10" />Ŋ'eyii Yeso me pyɛ, baal b'ádzii ndɛ y'atam ange-kuun ye buaal afuul ndɛ otsɛn b'ãmboo m'eti ndɛ. <verse eid="MRK 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 4:11" />Ndɛ obveel bɔ ndiri: «Me byɛ, Nziã osi kwɛn byɛ eyɛɛ ãndɔɔ mã m'elwɔɔn m'ãtal Okwɛn o Nziã, kɛn a me b'onkwel-a-nzi, bɔ ayoo mɔ̃ kɛn a m'ãmboo. <verse eid="MRK 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 4:12" />M'emfa okyɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">bɔ atal bam ngesɛ, kɛn a bɔ ki amwɛn pyɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">bvool ayoo bam ngesɛ, kɛn a bɔ otsɛn okwaal wɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">owɛɛl bɔ ayebvool ola Nziã bvool ndɛ odzeel ãbi ã bɔ.»<verse eid="MRK 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Otsɛn o mboo a ɔ̃kwɛn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 4:13" />Obobɔ, Yeso bvool olieel bɔ bubu: «Byɛ k'ebɔɔ otsɛn o mboo yi wɛ, ke byɛ m'ãsiil otsɛn o bwɛn-a-bwɛn ebɔɔ? <verse eid="MRK 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 4:14" />Ɔ̃kwɛn, eli mbuul wu akwɛn Endɔɔ e Nziã. <verse eid="MRK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 4:15" />Baal b'ali nku-a-ku a nkuul, eli baal bɛn akwɛn Endɔɔ e Nziã onse bɔ. Kɛn a ŋ'eyoo bɔ lɔ alili oŋɔ̃, Satana oyembaal Endɔɔ li akwɛn onse bɔ. <verse eid="MRK 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 4:16" />Bakyɛ b'ayɔɔ nsia ke mboo yi y'ãnkɔɔn, eli bɛn ŋ'eyoo bɔ Endɔɔ, bɔ ayɔɔ lɔ y'esɛ kɛn alili oŋɔ̃. <verse eid="MRK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 4:17" />Kɛn onge bɛn bɔ k'ali y'ɛ̃dza wɛ, bɔ k'ayiil y'Endɔɔ olɔ wɛ. Ŋ'eyii emwɛn bɔ fool wuo ŋ'ayii atuaal bɔ mpal me ndɔɔ Endɔɔ olɔ, oŋɔ̃ bɔ abvi. <verse eid="MRK 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 4:18" />Bakyɛ b'ayɔɔ nsia onse ãnsiɛɛn, eli baal b'ayoo Endɔɔ. <verse eid="MRK 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 4:19" />Kɛn ãtsam me ndɔɔ eluɔ bvi ɔ̃kiri, pfuru li epfuru opfel baal, y'efua bvi emfa bwɛn emfa, efoo Endɔɔ olɔ, kwɛn lɔ ebee nsia oburu. <verse eid="MRK 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 4:20" />Bakyɛ b'ayɔɔ nsia onse nsie yi mvɛ-mvɛ, eli baal b'ayoo Endɔɔ, ayɔɔ lɔ, bu aburu nsia. Ekwɛn kyɛn eburu nsia ãnku-ãtyel (30), kikyɛ ãnku-ãsɛɛn (60), kikyɛ ɔ̃nkam (100).»<verse eid="MRK 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mboo a mbunda bwɛn lemvɛɛl</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 4:21" />Yeso bvool olieel bɔ bubu: «Mbuul k'andɛɛl mbunda me ndɔɔ yi ampfeel ndɛ kantin wuo yi asuul ndɛ ke nsɛn a ntal wɛ, me ndɔɔ yi asuul ndɛ nkal eluɔ ki abendɔɔl ndɛ. <verse eid="MRK 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 4:22" />Ke ngwel wɛ, ndɔɔ yueel yi m'edziɔɔn èpal ke taan, bvool ndɔɔ yueel yi m'okwɛɛ èmɔɔn kal-a-kal. <verse eid="MRK 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 4:23" />Yɔɔl mbuul wa y'ãtswi m'ayoo, ayoo!»<verse eid="MRK 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 4:24" />Yeso bvool olieel bɔ bubu: «Ekal y'onkyab me m'ebeyoo byɛ! Nziã akieel awa byɛ me lemvɛɛl li ebewa byɛ bakyɛ, bvool ndɛ àkool b'onduru! <verse eid="MRK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 4:25" />Ke ngwel wɛ, mbuul wu oli y'elu-luɔ, àwa ndɛ bvool, kɛn a wɛn kyam pyɛ, àmbaal ndɛ onkyam k'emã-mã ki eli a ndɛ.»<verse eid="MRK 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mboo a nsia yi emɛn yam-a-yam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 4:26" />Yeso olieel bvool bubu: «Okwɛn o Nziã oli onge mbuul ngɔmɔ̃ wu oyiri nsia onse nguun a ndɛ, <verse eid="MRK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 4:27" />onkyam ŋɛn ndɛ olaal twal wuo osi ɛ̃nsiil, tsia mwiĩ, nsia oyɔ emɛn bvool eyal m'emfa kyɛn ndɛ ki ayɛɛ pyɛ. <verse eid="MRK 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 4:28" />Nsie yam-a-yam esuul ɔ̃ti amɛn, ŋ'ɛ̃kwel kɛn yɔ epaal ɔ̃swɛɛn, ke mbee oŋɔ̃ ɔ̃swɛɛn opaal lesia li ebwee bvool nsia e bele bu eluul ɔ̃nki a lɔ tɔ. <verse eid="MRK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 4:29" />Obobɔ, ŋ'eyel nsia, mbuul obvuru ɔ̃sal me mbieel yi ɔ̃yiin-a-yiin, ke ngwel wɛ, lio li aka nsia ŋ'ekoo.»<verse eid="MRK 4:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mboo a lesia li mutaad</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 4:30" />Yeso olieel bvool bubu: «Bia-byɛ Okwɛn o Nziã bwɛn-a-bwɛn emvɛɛl? Bia-byɛ mboo mã eta me ndɔɔ yi esuo emfa ki eli bɔ? <verse eid="MRK 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 4:31" />Okwɛn o Nziã oli onge lesia li mutaade lɛn, me lio li akwɛn lɔ onse nsie, lɔ enduru nsia yueel yi ɔ̃kiri m'otsiaal. <verse eid="MRK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 4:32" />Kɛn a ke mbee a ŋ'akwɛn lɔ, lɔ emɛn, bu enduru ɛ̃ti mvieel mi onse nguun. Lɔ elɔ ãpɔɔ̃ m'ãnɛn, m'emfa kyɛn, aywɛn akoo m'oyekal ke nsɛn edzuun e ndɛ.»<verse eid="MRK 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 4:33" />Yeso áketee bɔ Endɔɔ e Nziã m'ãmboo bibi m'obobɔ, m'emfa kyɛn bɔ akoo k'akwaal otsɛn. <verse eid="MRK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 4:34" />Ndɛ k'ákeywɛn mboo ota wɛ ŋ'ekeyɛɛn ndɛ ye bɔ. Kɛn a me pyɛ, ndɛ ákebɛɛl ayio a ndɛ ãndɔɔ mam mbueel.<verse eid="MRK 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso oyiaan mfel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 4:35" />M'ãnkunkwal mã tsoo lili olɔ, Yeso olieel ayio a ndɛ ndiri: «Bia-byɛ eyi ongwel a baã!» <verse eid="MRK 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 4:36" />Bɔ asiil embuul, ayio bu abiri ndɛ onse ebɛɛ. Éli hɛ̃ y'ebɛɛ bvikyɛ tsotsoo a ndɛ. <verse eid="MRK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 4:37" />Tal kwɛn mfel wa kokɔ obvi opob, epoo eyenziool ebɛɛ, kyɛ eyii eluul m'ãdza. <verse eid="MRK 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 4:38" />Kɛn a ndɛ, ndɛ álaal twal ke mbee ebɛɛ, ásoo ɔ̃tswɛ nkal esoo. Ayio aseel ndɛ ndiri: «Ɔ̃tee, bia-byɛ olɔ ekwi! K'esa yɛ ãwua wɛ?» <verse eid="MRK 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 4:39" />Yeso ayesiool, oyiaan mfel bvool oyɛɛn ãdza ndiri: «Ɔ̃lii! Wuun-pi!» Obobɔ, mfel ofi, ɔ̃li bu abvi ndyam piɛɛl! <verse eid="MRK 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 4:40" />Yeso olieel bɔ bubu: «M'emã byɛ eli ɛ̃bu-buɔ? Byɛ kɛn okiool pyɛ?» <verse eid="MRK 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 4:41" />Kɛn ayio buɔ bo bibi osiin bɔ, bu abvi oyɛɛn bam-a-bam ndiri: «Wu mbuul nã ali, wɛn okyam mfel ayoo ndɛ! Ãdza hɛ̃ ãyoo ndɛ!»<verse eid="MRK 4:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MRK 5" />
  <para style="s1">Yeso oboo mbuul wa y'ɔ̃fel wu ɔ̃bi-ɔ̃bi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 5:1" />Yeso y'ayio a ndɛ atɔ ongwel a baã k'etswi e nsie ki Afi-ngeledza. <verse eid="MRK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 5:2" />Kɛn a ŋ'epal Yeso onse ebɛɛ, mbuul ngɔmɔ̃ opal onse ãmpiɛɛn, oyemwɛɛn ye ndɛ. Mbuul ondɛ áli y'ɔ̃fel wu ɔ̃bi-ɔ̃bi. <verse eid="MRK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 5:3" />Ndɛ ákekal onse ãmpiɛɛn, mbuul si ngɔmɔ̃ k'ákekoo bvool k'akuru ndɛ wɛ, onkyam m'ãmpaa. <verse eid="MRK 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 5:4" />Ke ngwel wɛ, nsa bibi, ákelɔ ndɛ ãndaa me mviil, bvool ákekuru ndɛ ãmpaa. Kɛn a ndɛ áketsiil ãmpaa, bvool ákebwɔɔl ãndaa. Mbuul si ɔ̃mɔ̃ wa ye mpɛn yi akuaal ndɛ k'áli wɛ. <verse eid="MRK 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 5:5" />Tsia mwiĩ, ndɛ ákekal onse ãmpiɛɛn bvool onse ãnkio, akuaal ɛ̃sɔɔl bvool atɛn nzuru ãbwɔɔ m'ãnkɔɔn. <verse eid="MRK 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 5:6" />Ndɛ otaal Yeso lala, otsuu ntiin, bu ayebva ãbuo ke nkwel a ndɛ. <verse eid="MRK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 5:7" />Ndɛ obiool me nkii yi kokɔ ndiri: «Yeso, Muaan a Nziã-a-Mpuu, yɛ ye mɛ̃ emã? Mɛ̃ mbuɛɛn yɛ me nkuũ a Nziã, bee mɛ̃ mpal otuaal!» <verse eid="MRK 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 5:8" />Ndɛ oyɛɛn obobɔ, me ndɔɔ yɛn Yeso ákeliaal ndiri: «Pal onse mbuul wu, yɛ wu ɔ̃fel wu ɔ̃bi-ɔ̃bi!» <verse eid="MRK 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 5:9" />Yeso ofuul mbuul ondɛ ndiri: «Nkuũ a yɛ nã?» Ndɛ obveel ndiri: «Nkuũ a mɛ̃ “Boo-boo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.9 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Boo-boo. </char><char style="ft" closed="false">M'ɔ̃nywã wa Ngelek, ati Nkuun oyɔ me «Legiɔn», ŋ'ayɛɛn nkel yi m'ambwel-mbwel amiil asɛɛn.</char></note>”, ke ngwel wɛ bee ɔ̃bɔbɔ eli.» <verse eid="MRK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 5:10" />Ndɛ olɛɛn Yeso bam y'ɔ̃tɛɛ̃ wueel ndiri abee bɔ onse ɔ̃kiri ondɛ otswɛɛl. <verse eid="MRK 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 5:11" />Ŋ'esa oŋɔ̃, éli y'ekel li anguru li bibi li ékedza tsotsoo a nkio. <verse eid="MRK 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 5:12" />Ɛ̃fel mi ɛ̃bi-ɛ̃bi omyɛ̃ ɛ̃lɛɛn Yeso ndiri: «Yuɔɔl bee onse anguru ba, kwɛn bee eyesam onse bɔ!» <verse eid="MRK 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 5:13" />Yeso bu awi myɛ̃ nkuul. Obobɔ, ɛ̃fel mi ɛ̃bi-ɛ̃bi ɛ̃pal onse mbuul ondɛ, bu ɛ̃yesam onse anguru. Ekel li anguru ekuul nzuru ke ywel a nkio, eyeyiool onse baã, bu edziin. Anguru obɔ áli onse ab'amiil buaal (2.000). <verse eid="MRK 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 5:14" />Baal b'ákekiaal anguru obɔ abal, bu ayetsal nsia onse bviil y'ãŋaan. Obobɔ, baal ayetal m'ãbwel. <verse eid="MRK 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 5:15" />Ŋ'etɔ bɔ tsotsoo a Yeso, bɔ amwɛn mbuul wu áli y'ɛ̃fel mi ɛ̃bi-ɛ̃bi myam boo-boo me tsɛn oŋɔ̃, álaal ekɔ bvool áli y'ombuul ondɛ bam bueel. Bɔ buɔ bu obɔɔ. <verse eid="MRK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 5:16" />B'ámwɛn ndɔɔ oyɔ ati bɔ ɔ̃sam a m'ã́bwel me mbuul wu áli y'ɛ̃fel mi ɛ̃bi-ɛ̃bi ye m'ã́bwel m'anguru. <verse eid="MRK 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 5:17" />Obobɔ, bɔ abvi Yeso oluɔɔn ndiri ambal ke nsie a bɔ. <verse eid="MRK 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 5:18" />Me lio li eyesam Yeso onse ebɛɛ, mbuul wu áli y'ɛ̃fel mi ɛ̃bi-ɛ̃bi ondɛ oluɔɔn ndɛ ndiri ayɔɔl ndɛ akal ye ndɛ. <verse eid="MRK 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 5:19" />Kɛn a Yeso obee, bu alieel ndɛ bubu: «Yi nzɔ ola ba yɛ, liaal bɔ mbueel m'esi Mfam yɛ y'emfa ki esio ndɛ yɛ nyiĩ.» <verse eid="MRK 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 5:20" />Mbuul ondɛ oyɛn, bu abvi nsia a mbueel m'esi Yeso ndɛ otsal, m'etswi e nsie ki Ãbviil kuun. Bu esi baal bueel ɛ̃kam.<verse eid="MRK 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeso oboo ɔ̃kaal bvool oseel nsam ɔ̃kaal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 5:21" />Yeso oyebvool ŋ'afi ongwel a baã m'ebɛɛ. Embuul e baal eyebvɔɔn tsotsoo a ndɛ. Ndɛ áli nku-a-nku baã olɔ. <verse eid="MRK 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 5:22" />Mbuul ngɔmɔ̃ onse amfam a nzɔ a ãbuɛɛn a Ayuda oyi. Nkuũ a ndɛ Dzayilos. Ŋ'emwɛn ndɛ Yeso, ndɛ oyetyal nzuru ke ntaã e ndɛ, <verse eid="MRK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 5:23" />bu aluɔɔn ndɛ y'ɔ̃tɛɛ̃ ndiri: «Mɛ̃ nsam a ɔ̃kaal abekɔɔ y'epfu. Ya kwɛn yɛ ndɔɔl ndɛ kuɔɔl, kwɛn ndɛ abvuul bvool akal m'omwiĩ!» <verse eid="MRK 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 5:24" />Yeso oyɛn ye ndɛ. Embuul e baal ékenɔɔn a ndɛ bvool ékeywɛn ndɛ ngwel-a-ngwel.<verse eid="MRK 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 5:25" />Ŋ'esa oŋɔ̃, ɔ̃kaal ngɔmɔ̃ wu áli y'oluu b'ékepal ãkel fa mvel kuun ye yuaal áli oŋɔ̃. <verse eid="MRK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 5:26" />Ndɛ ál'amaamwɛn mpal bibi ol'aboo. Ndɛ ál'alemaatsal nzi e ndɛ yueel, kɛn a ndɛ k'ábɔɔ o ngesɛ wɛ, nzuru a ndɛ ékeswɛɛn kɛn oswɛɛn. <verse eid="MRK 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 5:27" />Ŋ'eyoo ndɛ baal ata ɔ̃sam a Yeso, ndɛ oyɛn onse embuul ãmbee-mbee ã Yeso, bu asiin ekɔ e ndɛ. <verse eid="MRK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 5:28" />Ke ngwel wɛ, ndɛ ákeyɛɛn ndiri: «Okɛɛn mɛ̃ nsiin si-ekal ekɔ e ndɛ, mɛ̃ olɔ mvuul!» <verse eid="MRK 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 5:29" />Kɛn ɛ̃kiri-anka oŋɔ̃, ndɛ ãkel ãtɛɛn, bu amwɛn kwɛn onse nzuru a ndɛ ndɛ obvuul m'oluu o ndɛ. <verse eid="MRK 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 5:30" />Kɛn alili oŋɔ̃, Yeso oyeyɛɛ kwɛn mpɛn epal onse ndɛ. Ndɛ okɔɔl osɔɔn embuul, bu afuul ndiri: «Wu osiin ekɔ e mɛ̃ nã?» <verse eid="MRK 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 5:31" />Ayio a ndɛ abveel ndɛ ndiri: «Yɛ amwɛn k'eywɛn embuul yɛ ngwel-a-ngwel, bɛn yɛ atɔ m'ofuul wɛn: “ Wu osiin mɛ̃ nã”?» <verse eid="MRK 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 5:32" />Kɛn a Yeso áketal nku-a-nku a ndɛ me ndɔɔ yi amwɛn wu ási obobɔ. <verse eid="MRK 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 5:33" />Ɔ̃kaal ondɛ buɔ obɔɔ, ke ngwel wɛ ndɛ oyɛɛ ndɔɔ yi ebwek onse ndɛ. Ndɛ oyetyal nzuru ke ntaã e Yeso, bu alieel ndɛ otaa-taa bam bueel. <verse eid="MRK 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 5:34" />Kɛn a Yeso olieel ndɛ bubu: «Muaan a mɛ̃, okiool o yɛ obvuul yɛ! Yi onse opi bvool bvuul m'oluu o yɛ!»<verse eid="MRK 5:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 5:35" />Ŋ'éli Yeso kɛn y'oyɛɛn m'ɔnywã, baal b'afi ola Yayilos, wu mfam a nzɔ a ãbuɛɛn a Ayuda, alieel ndɛ ndiri: «Muaan a yɛ amaakwa, bee ɔ̃tee mpal yi ngwel abetuaal!» <verse eid="MRK 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 5:36" />Kɛn a ŋ'eyoo Yeso ãyɛɛn omɔ̃, ndɛ olieel mfam a nzɔ a ãbuɛɛn a Ayuda ndiri: «Bee ye buɔ akal, kal kɛn a y'okiool!» <verse eid="MRK 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 5:37" />Ndɛ k'awi mbuul ɔ̃kyam nkuul yi ayesuul ndɛ wɛ. B'ewi ndɛ nkuul yi ayesuul ndɛ kɛn a Piɛɛl, ye Dzak ye Dzaã, wu muaan-ngoo a ndɛ wu Dzak. <verse eid="MRK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 5:38" />Ŋ'etɔ bɔ nzɔ a mfam nzɔ a ãbuɛɛn a Ayuda, Yeso omwɛn baal onse akɔɔ-kɔɔ, bɔ ákelel bvool ákekuaal ɛ̃sɔɔl bibi. <verse eid="MRK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 5:39" />Ndɛ osam onse nzɔ, bu alieel bɔ bubu: «Ndɔɔ mã yi eli byɛ onse akɔɔ-kɔɔ bvool onse elel? Muaan k'akwi wɛ, ndɛ twal alaal.» <verse eid="MRK 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 5:40" />Kɛn a bɔ abvi ndɛ osɔɔl. Kɛn a ndɛ opaal bɔ bueel onse nzɔ, osiil tal ye ngoo a muaan y'ayio ange-atyel, bu asam onse mboo yi éli muaan. <verse eid="MRK 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 5:41" />Ndɛ osiin ndɛ me kuɔɔl y'ãyɛɛn m'ɔ̃nywã ndiri: «Talita kumi!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.41 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Talita kumi! </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Oyɛɛn obɔ oli m'ɔ̃nywã wu Alameyɛ̃. Ɔ̃nywã ondɛ wu ékeliaal Ayuda me lio e Yeso.</char></note>» Ŋ'ayɛɛn ndiri: «Nsam-ɔ̃kaal, mɛ̃ ngyɛɛn yɛ wɛn siool!» <verse eid="MRK 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 5:42" />Kɛn a mɛ̃ alili oŋɔ̃, nsam-ɔ̃kaal etɛɛn, bu ebvi odzuu. Muaan ondɛ áli me mvel kuun ye yuaal. Baal bueel ongɛɛ bo kokɔ bu obɔɔ. <verse eid="MRK 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 5:43" />Kɛn a Yeso owi bɔ ãnkukwa bam ndiri abee mbuul si ngɔmɔ̃ ndɔɔ oyɔ oliaal. Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, ndɛ olieel bɔ ndiri: «Ewa ndɛ bvi-odza.»<verse eid="MRK 5:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MRK 6" />
  <para style="s1">Baal a Nadzalet abee k'akiool Yeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 6:1" />Yeso ombal oŋɔ̃, bu ayɛn Nadzalet, bviil li ékwel ndɛ. Ayio ayɛn ye ndɛ. <verse eid="MRK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 6:2" />Me tsoo li saba, ndɛ obvi oyiool onse nzɔ a ãbuɛɛn a Ayuda. Embuul e baal b'ákeyoo ndɛ ákekam bibi. Bɔ ákefuul bam-a-bam ndiri: «Ndɛ ãndɔɔ mã mbueel nã kwɛn afi a mɔ̃? Wu owi ndɛ ãyal y'okwɛn b'asa emvieel bvi bubu nã? <verse eid="MRK 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 6:3" />Ndɛ wu k'ɔ̃foo-ãnzɔ wu muaan a Mali wɛ? Ndɛ ke muaan-ngoo a Dzak, wa Dzodze, wa Yude ye wa Simɔ̃ wɛ? Ankyel a ndɛ, ke b'abekal ye bia-byɛ ŋã wɛ?» Ãndɔɔ omɔ̃ bu ãsi kwɛn bɔ abee okiool. <verse eid="MRK 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 6:4" />Obobɔ, Yeso olieel bɔ bubu: «K'eli ye mboo yi abebee k'awa ɔ̃liaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã dzuun wɛ. Mboo yi abebee k'awa ndɛ dzuun kɛn ola b'áburu ndɛ, onse eburu e ndyam bvool onse nzɔ a ndyam.» <verse eid="MRK 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 6:5" />Yeso k'akoo k'asa emvieel si emɔ̃ ke Nadzalet wɛ. Ki esi ndɛ kɛn oboo b'eboo ndɛ anga-ãluu ke kwɛ m'ondɔɔl o bɔ kuɔɔl. <verse eid="MRK 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 6:6" />Yeso ákekam me ndɔɔ yi éywɛn baal a bviil olɔ okiool. Ndɛ ádzuu m'ãla mã nku-a-nku m'oyiool.<verse eid="MRK 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso oyuɔɔl antam kuun ye buaal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 6:7" />Yeso oti ayio kuun ye buaal mbel, bu abvi bɔ oyuɔɔl me bu-buaal. Ndɛ owi bɔ okwɛn nkal ɛ̃fel mi ɛ̃bi-ɛ̃bi. <verse eid="MRK 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 6:8" />Ndɛ owi bɔ ãnkukwa ndiri: «Ebee eluɔ si-ekal emɔ̃ obiri me ndɔɔ a dzwɛ. Ki ebiri byɛ kɛn ɔ̃mpaã. Ebee mampa obiri, ekal ɔ̃paa, ekal nzi onse pusi. <verse eid="MRK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 6:9" />Elaal asimpal me ntaã, kɛn ebee ekɔ ki abendɔɔl ke ywel a kikyɛ bviaal obiri.» <verse eid="MRK 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 6:10" />Yeso bvool oyɛɛn bɔ bubu: «Ŋ'esam byɛ onse nzɔ ngamɔ̃, ekal onse yɔ tiil k'èmbal byɛ oŋɔ̃. <verse eid="MRK 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 6:11" />Okɛɛn baal b'ola ngɔmɔ̃ abee k'ayɔɔ byɛ bvool k'ayoo byɛ, ŋ'èmbal byɛ oŋɔ̃, ekweel ɔ̃fel a ntaã e byɛ: Okyɛ eliĩ ki esuo byɛ bɔ kwɛn bɔ asi obi.» <verse eid="MRK 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 6:12" />Antam ayɛn, bu atsal nsia ola baal bueel ndiri akaal ɛ̃kwal. <verse eid="MRK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 6:13" />Bɔ atswɛɛl ɛ̃fel mi ɛ̃bi-ɛ̃bi bibi, asɛɛn anga-ãluu bibi mbaal, bvool aboo bɔ.<verse eid="MRK 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Epfu e Dzaã Batis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 6:14" />Ŋ'esa oŋɔ̃, ɔ̃kwɛn Elode ákeyoo k'abeyɛɛn me ndɔɔ a Yeso, ke ngwel wɛ, nsia a ndɛ éketsɔɔn ãmboo mbueel. Bakyɛ ákeyɛɛn ndiri: «Dzaã Batis osiool onse b'ákwi-ákwi! Obɔ otsɛn bɛn ndɛ oli ye waan li abesa emvieel.» <verse eid="MRK 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 6:15" />Kɛn a bakyɛ ákeyɛɛn ndiri: «Eli ɔ̃liaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã Eli.» Bakyɛ bvool ákeyɛɛn ndiri: «Eli ngɔmɔ̃ onse aliaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã.» <verse eid="MRK 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 6:16" />Ŋ'eyoo Elode ãndɔɔ omɔ̃, ndɛ oyɛɛn bubu: «Dzaã ondɛ, wɛn mɛ̃ ndyam etsiil ɔ̃tswɛ, ndɛ mbuul wu osiool!» <verse eid="MRK 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 6:17" />Ke ngwel wɛ, Elode átam Dzaã osiin bvool átam k'akuru ndɛ me bwal. Eli me ndɔɔ a Elodiade wu ébaal Elode, kwɛn ŋɛn ndɛ áli ɔ̃kal a Filipe wu muaan-ngoo a ndɛ. <verse eid="MRK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 6:18" />Ke ngwel wɛ Dzaã ákeliaal Elode ndiri: «K'awi yɛ nkuul yi awal ɔ̃kal a muaan-ngoo a yɛ wɛ!» <verse eid="MRK 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 6:19" />Elodiade áluul me mpuru fa me ndɔɔ a Dzaã bvool ákedzii k'abam ndɛ, kɛn a ndɛ k'ákekoo wɛ, <verse eid="MRK 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 6:20" />me ndɔɔ yɛn, Elode áli ye buɔ o Dzaã, ke ngwel wɛ ndɛ áyɛɛ ndiri Dzaã oli mbuul wa dzu bvool wa ngel, bvool ndɛ ákefoo ndɛ. Ŋ'ékeyoo ndɛ Dzaã, ndɛ ãyal ã́kefa. Kɛn a ndɛ ákedzii k'ayoo ndɛ. <verse eid="MRK 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 6:21" />Kɛn a tsoo ngelemɔ̃, Elodiade obɔɔ mpwee yi ngesɛ yɛn, me tsoo li áburu Elode, ndɛ obɛɛl mfuun y'asal a ndɛ bam bueel, y'amfam b'ambwel-mbwel y'akuul-kuul a Ngalile. <verse eid="MRK 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 6:22" />Muaan a Elodiade wu ɔ̃kaal osam onse nzɔ, bu abvi okɛn. Ndɛ osi Elode ye baal b'éti ndɛ ãmbel esɛ. Ɔ̃kwɛn olieel nsam-ɔ̃kaal bubu: «Sɔɔ eluɔ ki edzii yɛ ola mɛ̃, mɛ̃ èwa yɛ kyɛ.» <verse eid="MRK 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 6:23" />Ndɛ olab ndɛ ɔ̃kyel bam ndiri: «Mɛ̃ èwa yɛ ki èsɔɔ yɛ, onkyam epie ki okwɛn o mɛ̃.» <verse eid="MRK 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 6:24" />Muaan opal me ndɔɔ yi afuul ãtsam ã ngoo a ndɛ ndiri: «Ki èsɔɔ mɛ̃ emã?» Ngoo obveel ndɛ bubu: «Sɔɔ ɔ̃tswɛ a Dzaã Batis.» <verse eid="MRK 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 6:25" />Muaan okɔɔl wa-a-wa ol'ɔ̃kwɛn, bu asɔɔ ola ndɛ bubu: «Mɛ̃ nzii kwɛn yɛ wa mɛ̃ tswa-a-tswa ŋã ɔ̃tswɛ a Dzaã Batis onse saan.» <verse eid="MRK 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 6:26" />Ɔ̃kwɛn ãwua ãsiin bibi, kɛn a ndɛ k'akoo k'abee b'esɔɔ ndɛ ola ndɛ wɛ, me ndɔɔ ɔ̃kyel wu elab ndɛ bvool me ndɔɔ a baal b'eti ndɛ ãmbel. <verse eid="MRK 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 6:27" />Kɛn alili oŋɔ̃, ndɛ otam mbwel-mbwel ngɔmɔ̃ ndiri aya y'ɔ̃tswɛ a Dzaã Batis. Mbwel-mbwel bu ayetsiil Dzaã ɔ̃tswɛ onse bwal. <verse eid="MRK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 6:28" />Ndɛ oyi y'ɔ̃tswɛ a Dzaã onse saan, owi ndɛ ola nsam-ɔ̃kaal, nsam-ɔ̃kaal bu ayewa ndɛ ola ngoo. <verse eid="MRK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 6:29" />Ŋ'eyoo ayio a Dzaã nsia oyɔ, bɔ ayewal ebiĩ e ndɛ, bu ayelɔ onse mpiɛɛn.<verse eid="MRK 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso oliil abɔɔl amiin ataan (5.000) onse ɔ̃baan wa kɛɛ-kɛɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 6:30" />Ŋ'eyebvool antam, bɔ abvɔɔn tsotsoo a Yeso, bu alieel ndɛ mam mbueel m'esi bɔ ye m'eyiool bɔ. <verse eid="MRK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 6:31" />Obobɔ, Yeso olieel bɔ bubu: «Etswɛ eyi ke mboo yi me pyɛ, kwɛn byɛ ewuun etsi-tsiri.» Ke ngwel wɛ baal bibi ákefa ku ákebwel ku m'emfa kyɛn Yeso y'antam k'ákebɔɔ mpwee yi adza wɛ. <verse eid="MRK 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 6:32" />Bɔ bu ayɛn m'ebɛɛ ke mboo yi me pyɛ k'ɔ̃baan wa kɛɛ-kɛɛ. <verse eid="MRK 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 6:33" />Kɛn a baal bibi amwɛn k'eyi bɔ bvool akwaal otsɛn o mboo yi ékeyi bɔ. Obobɔ, bɔ afi ãbviil mbueel, ayi me nsie-a-nsie me ntiin, bu atɔ okɔ ɛ̃kwel ɛ̃ Yeso y'antam a ndɛ. <verse eid="MRK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 6:34" />Ŋ'epal Yeso onse ebɛɛ, ndɛ omwɛn ɔ̃bɔbɔ a baal obɔ, ɔ̃kwal a ndɛ oyoo ãwua bibi me ndɔɔ a bɔ, ke ngwel wɛ bɔ áli onge emɛmɛɛ̃ bvi ywɛn ɔ̃mbuaal. Ndɛ bu abvi bɔ ãndɔɔ bibi oyiool. <verse eid="MRK 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 6:35" />Onge bɛn tal alemeyel ayio a Yeso ayi ola ndɛ, me ndɔɔ yi aliaal ndɛ bubu: «Tal emeyel bvool bia-byɛ ŋã eli k'ɔ̃baan. <verse eid="MRK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 6:36" />Bveel baal ba ayi onse ãŋaan y'ãla mã nku-a-ku, me ndɔɔ yi asuun bvi-odza.» <verse eid="MRK 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 6:37" />Kɛn a Yeso obveel bɔ bubu: «Byam ewa bɔ bvi-odza!» Bɔ afuul ndɛ bubu: «Yɛ dzii kwɛn bee eyesuun bvi-odza bvi nzi yi ãbvieel ɛ̃nkam mviaal (200), me ndɔɔ yi eliil bɔ?» <verse eid="MRK 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 6:38" />Yeso olieel bɔ bubu: «Byɛ amampa kwɛ eli a bɔ? Eyetal.» Bɔ ayetal, ke mbee oŋɔ̃ bɔ alieel ndɛ ndiri: «Bee eli y'amampa ataan y'atswi buaal.» <verse eid="MRK 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 6:39" />Obobɔ, Yeso otam ndiri amviaal baal bueel nsɛn nkal bviĩ bvi ebee m'ãnkel m'ãnkel. <verse eid="MRK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 6:40" />Baal bu abvi ãnsɛn m'ãnkel m'ɔ̃kam (100), ye m'ãku-ãtaan (50). <verse eid="MRK 6:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 6:41" />Yeso owel amampa ange-ataan y'atswi ange buaal. Ndɛ oseel mviil ke ywel bvool otuɛɛn Nziã. Ndɛ otsiil amampa, bu awi ayio kwɛn bɔ akab baal. Ndɛ hɛ̃ okab atswi ange-buaal me baal bueel. <verse eid="MRK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 6:42" />Mbuul bwɛn a mbuul odzi oyool. <verse eid="MRK 6:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 6:43" />Ayio abiri etswel bvi amampa ye bvi atswi bvi esiil, onse ãnsia kuun ye mbuaal. <verse eid="MRK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 6:44" />Baal b'ádzi amampa áli abɔɔl amiin ataan (5.000).<verse eid="MRK 6:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso odzuu nkal ãdza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 6:45" />Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, Yeso oywɛɛn ayio a ndɛ k'asam m'ebɛɛ kwɛn bɔ atsɔɔn ongwel a baã, sua bviil li Betesayida, kwɛn ŋɛn, ndyam abebveel embuul e baal. <verse eid="MRK 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 6:46" />Ŋ'eman ndɛ bɔ obveel, ndɛ oyɛn nkal nkio me ndɔɔ yi abuɛɛn. <verse eid="MRK 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 6:47" />Ŋ'eyii m'ãnkukwal, ebɛɛ al'eyii kal-a-kal a baã, Yeso bu asiil ndyam me nsie. <verse eid="MRK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 6:48" />Ndɛ omwɛn kwɛn ayio a ndɛ áli ye fool m'odzoo o nkɛɛ, nzal-a-ŋɛn mfel ákebveel bɔ mbee. Ŋ'eyii etsa bviil, ndɛ oyii aya sua bɔ m'odzuu nkal ãdza bvool oyii abii k'anduru bɔ. <verse eid="MRK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 6:49" />Ŋ'emwɛn bɔ ndɛ adzuu nkal ãdza, bɔ abvi otsam ndiri ɔ̃kwii, bɔ bu abvi ɛ̃sɔɔl okuaal. <verse eid="MRK 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 6:50" />Ke ngwel wɛ, bueel ákemwɛn ndɛ bvool embangɛɛ ébɔɔ bɔ. Kɛn alili oŋɔ̃, ndɛ olieel bɔ bubu: «Ekal ye mpɛn, eli mɛ̃! Ebee buɔ oyoo!» <verse eid="MRK 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 6:51" />Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, ndɛ osam onse ebɛɛ ye bɔ, mfel bu afi. Ayio ongɛɛ osi. <verse eid="MRK 6:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 6:52" />Ke ngwel wɛ, bɔ k'ákwaal otsɛn o ndɔɔ yi etal emvieel ki amampa wɛ. Ãyal ã bɔ k'ã́koo m'okwaal b'otsɛn o yɔ wɛ.<verse eid="MRK 6:52" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Oboo o baal ke Ngenesalet</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 6:53" />Yeso y'ayio a ndɛ atsiil baã, asiɛɛn ke nsie yi Ngenesalet, bu akuru ebɛɛ e bɔ. <verse eid="MRK 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 6:54" />Ŋ'epal bɔ onse ebɛɛ, baal ayɛɛ Yeso kɛn alili oŋɔ̃. <verse eid="MRK 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 6:55" />Obobɔ, baal atsuu ntiin m'etswi e nsie kieel bvool abiri ndɛ anga-ãluu nkal ãntal m'abieel m'ãmboo mbueel m'ékeyoo bɔ ndiri ndɛ áli okɔ. <verse eid="MRK 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 6:56" />Ãmboo mbueel m'ékeyi Yeso, onse ãbviil, onse ãla wuo onse ãŋaan, baal ákeya anga-ãluu osuul ke taan bvool ákeluɔɔn ndɛ k'awa bɔ nkuul yi akwaal si-ekal nswɛɛ ekɔ e ndɛ. Bueel b'ásiin yɔ ábvuul.<verse eid="MRK 6:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MRK 7" />
  <para style="s1">Yeso y'onkɔɔ b'Ayuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 7:1" />Afalisaye y'ayiool b'ãngel ke kwɛ afi Yelusalem ayebvɔɔn nku-a-nku a Yeso. <verse eid="MRK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 7:2" />Bɔ amwɛn kwɛn ayio a ndɛ bakyɛ abedza mviɔɔl mbiin, ŋ'ayɛɛn ndiri mviɔɔl myɛn k'asuɔɔl wɛ, m'emfa ki onkɔɔ. <verse eid="MRK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 7:3" />Ke yam, Afalisaye y'Ayuda bueel k'abedza wɛ okɛɛn k'asuɔɔl mviɔɔl ngesɛ-ngesɛ wɛ, me ndɔɔ yɛn bɔ abelweel onkɔɔ o bɔ. <verse eid="MRK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 7:4" />Ŋɛn bɔ afi taan, bɔ k'abedza wɛ okɛɛn bɔ k'asuɔɔl ãnzuru wɛ. Bɔ abelweel ãngel mãkyɛ bibi m'onkɔɔ, onge osuɔɔl b'ãmbiɔ, b'ãmbuu, b'asaan b'asi me bvieel li bolonze [ye b'ãntal.]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ndɔɔ oyɔ k'ákel yɔ onse ɛ̃nkaan mikyɛ mi tsɔɔn-tsɔɔn wɛ.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 7:5" />Obɔ otsɛn bɛn Afalisaye y'ayiool b'ãngel afuul Yeso ndiri: «Otsɛn omã bɛn ayio a yɛ k'alweel onkɔɔ o bia-byɛ wɛ? Bɔ abedza mviɔɔl mbiin.» <verse eid="MRK 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 7:6" />Yeso obveel bɔ ndiri: «Byɛ baal a pfuru eli! Edzayi áli y'ɔ̃dzoo wu élieel ndɛ ãndɔɔ m'ã́fi ola Nziã me ndɔɔ a byɛ, ndiri:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:6">“Baal ba, abelweel mɛ̃ kɛn a m'ɔ̃nywã,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:6">kɛn ɛ̃kwal ɛ̃ bɔ ɛ̃li lala ye mɛ̃.<verse eid="MRK 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 7:7" />Olweel b'ebelweel bɔ mɛ̃ k'oli y'otsɛn wɛ, ke ngwel wɛ ãndɔɔ m'ebeyiool bɔ kɛn ãngel m'ombuul.”<verse eid="MRK 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 7:8" />Byɛ eyɔɔl ãngel ã Nziã, me ndɔɔ yi elweel onkɔɔ b'ombuul.» <verse eid="MRK 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 7:9" />Yeso bvool olweel bubu: «Byɛ, byɛ esuul ãngel ã Nziã me pyɛ, me ndɔɔ yi ekiaal onkɔɔ o byam! <verse eid="MRK 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 7:10" />Ke ngwel wɛ, Moyize áyɛɛn bubu: “Lweel tal ye ngoo a yɛ”, bvool ndiri: “Mbuul wu adza tal wuo ngoo a ndɛ mpaan, ebvaan abam ndɛ.” <verse eid="MRK 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 7:11" />Kɛn a byɛ, byɛ ebeyiool ndiri okɛɛn mbuul olieel tal wuo ngoo a ndɛ ndiri: “Mɛ̃ al'olɔ mbɔɔ eluɔ ki ewa yɛ m'owuaal a yɛ. Kɛn a kyɛ ki ewa mɛ̃ Nziã kab<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.11 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ki ewa mɛ̃ Nziã kab </char><char style="ft" closed="false">M'ɔ̃nywã wa Ngelek, ati eluɔ ki awa Nziã kab me «Kɔɔban.»</char></note>.” <verse eid="MRK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 7:12" />M'emfa okyɛ, byɛ ŋ'ewa ndɛ nkuul yi abee k'asa ndɔɔ me ndɔɔ a tal wuo ngoo a ndɛ. <verse eid="MRK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 7:13" />Byɛ oŋɔ̃ ŋ'ebembaal Endɔɔ e Nziã me ndɔɔ a onkɔɔ b'eyiool byɛ, bvool byɛ ebesa ãndɔɔ ãkyam bibi m'emfa okyɛ.»<verse eid="MRK 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eluɔ ki esuul mbuul ye mbiin ke mviil ã Nziã</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 7:14" />Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, Yeso bvool oti embuul e baal mbel, bu ayɛɛn ndiri: «Byɛ bueel eyoo mɛ̃ bvool ekwaal otsɛn ngesɛ: <verse eid="MRK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 7:15" />Eluɔ ki efa nzi esam onse mwiĩ a mbuul k'esuul ndɛ ye mbiin ke nkwel a Nziã wɛ. Kɛn a ki epal onse mbuul, ki esuul mbuul ye mbiin ke nkwel a Nziã. [<verse eid="MRK 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 7:16" />Yɔɔl kwɛn wu y'ãtswi m'ayoo, ayoo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ndɔɔ oyɔ k'ákel yɔ onse ɛ̃nkaa mikyɛ mi tsɔɔn-tsɔɔn wɛ.</char></note>!]»<verse eid="MRK 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 7:17" />Ŋ'esiil Yeso embuul bvool osam onse nzɔ, ayio ndɛ afuul ndɛ otsɛn o mboo oyɔ. <verse eid="MRK 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 7:18" />Yeso obveel bɔ bubu: «Byɛ hɛ̃, byɛ eywɛn a ãyal? Eyɛɛ kwɛn k'eli y'eluɔ kyɛn, ŋ'efi kyɛ onkwel-a-nzi esam onse mwiĩ a mbuul, ekoo k'esuul ndɛ ye mbiin ke mviil ã Nziã wɛ, <verse eid="MRK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 7:19" />ke ngwel wɛ, kyɛ k'esam onse ɔ̃kwal a ndɛ wɛ, kɛn onse ɔ̃la a ndɛ, ke mbee oŋɔ̃ ndɛ ayeni kyɛ ke nkiin.» M'ãyɛɛn omɔ̃, Yeso osuo ndiri baal akoo k'adza ãtuɔ mam mbueel. <verse eid="MRK 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 7:20" />Ndɛ bvool olweel bubu: «Ki esuul mbuul ye mbiin ke mviil ã Nziã eli ki epal onse mbuul. <verse eid="MRK 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 7:21" />Ke ngwel wɛ, eli onse mwiĩ, onse ɔ̃kwal a mbuul ku ebefa ãtsam m'ãbi-ãbi mã: okal y'akaal wuo y'abɔɔl, oturu o pfuul, obam o baal, <verse eid="MRK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 7:22" />odzuu y'ɔ̃kal wuo y'ɔ̃lam a mbuul, pfuul o nzi, kyal, ãyal ãbi, ãndɔɔ m'esio, ɔ̃kwal nsɔɔ, kwee, odɛɛl o nzuru, oywɛn b'ãyal. <verse eid="MRK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 7:23" />Ãndɔɔ m'ãbi ãbi omɔ̃ mbueel ãbefa onse mwiĩ a mbuul bvool ãsuul ndɛ ye mbiin ke mviil ã Nziã.»<verse eid="MRK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okiool b'ɔ̃kaal wɛn k'ɔ̃yuda wɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 7:24" />Yeso ombal oŋɔ̃ oyɛn ke nsie yi Tiil. Ndɛ osam onse nzɔ ngamɔ̃ bvool k'adzii kwɛn baal ayɛɛ ndiri ndɛ oli oŋɔ̃ wɛ, kɛn a ndɛ k'akoo k'akal m'edziɔɔn wɛ. <verse eid="MRK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 7:25" />Alili oŋɔ̃, ɔ̃kaal ngɔmɔ̃ wɛn muaan wu ɔ̃kaal áli y'ɔ̃fel wu ɔ̃bi-ɔ̃bi oyoo nsia a ndɛ. Ndɛ oyetyal nzuru ke ntaã e ndɛ. <verse eid="MRK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 7:26" />Ɔ̃kaal o ndɛ k'áli ɔ̃yuda wɛ, áburu ndɛ ke Fenidzi, k'ɔ̃kiri wa Sili. Ndɛ oluɔɔn Yeso k'atswɛɛl ɔ̃fel wu ɔ̃bi-ɔ̃bi onse muaan a ndɛ. <verse eid="MRK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 7:27" />Kɛn a Yeso olieel ndɛ bubu: «Yɔɔl ŋ'ekwel kɛn baan adza ayool, ke ngwel wɛ, k'eli ngesɛ wɛ k'awal bvi odza e baan atyal ola baan b'amva.» <verse eid="MRK 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 7:28" />Kɛn ɔ̃kaal ondɛ obveel ndɛ bubu: «Mfam, amva ke nsɛn a misa mpii abedza ãmpiɛɛl m'etsuaal baan.» <verse eid="MRK 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 7:29" />Obobɔ Yeso olieel ndɛ bubu: «Me ndɔɔ yɛn yɛ bveel obobɔ, kɔɔl nzɔ, ɔ̃fel wu ɔ̃bi-ɔ̃bi amaapal onse muaan a yɛ.» <verse eid="MRK 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 7:30" />Ŋ'ekɔɔl ɔ̃kaal ondɛ nzɔ, ndɛ oyebɔɔ muaan a ndɛ bɔ nkal a ntal, ɔ̃fel wu ɔ̃bi-ɔ̃bi amaapal onse ndɛ.<verse eid="MRK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso oboo nkɛn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 7:31" />Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, Yeso ombal nsie yi Tiil, obwel li nsie yi Sidɔ̃ bu akɔɔl sua baã li Ngalile m'obwel me li nsie yi Ãbviil kuun. <verse eid="MRK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 7:32" />Ayi ndɛ ye mbuul ngɔmɔ̃ wu áli nkɛn bvool áli ye fool m'oyɛɛn. Aluɔɔn ndɛ k'andɔɔl ndɛ kuɔɔl. <verse eid="MRK 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 7:33" />Yeso opaal mbuul ondɛ onse embuul bu ayɛn ye ndɛ me pyɛ. Ndɛ olɔ ɛ̃liɛɛn onse ãtswi ã ndɛ, otsweel ãntɛɛ bu asiin elam e ndɛ m'eliɛɛn mi epwɛɛ ndɛ ãntɛɛ. <verse eid="MRK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 7:34" />Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, ndɛ oseel mviil ke ywel, odzuru ɔ̃fiaal bvool oyɛɛn ndiri: «Efata!» Ŋ'ayɛɛn ndiri «Dzweel nzuru!» <verse eid="MRK 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 7:35" />Alili oŋɔ̃, ãtswi ã mbuul ondɛ ãyɔɔl, elam e ndɛ enyiɔɔn, ndɛ bu abvi oyɛɛn ngesɛ. <verse eid="MRK 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 7:36" />Yeso bu awi bɔ ãnkunkwa ndiri abee mbuul ndɔɔ oyɔ oliaal. Kwɛn ŋɛn ndɛ owi bɔ ãnkunkwa, bɔ awɛɛl mpɛn m'otsal o nsia. <verse eid="MRK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 7:37" />Bɔ ɛ̃kam ɛ̃kesa bɔ bibi bvool àkeyɛɛn ndiri: «Mbueel m'esa ndɛ ãli ngesɛ ãyal pyɛ! Ndɛ asuul okyam ankɛn abvi oyoo, bɛn k'ayɛɛn wɛ obvi oyɛɛn!»<verse eid="MRK 7:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MRK 8" />
  <para style="s1">Yeso oliil baal amiil anã (4.000)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 8:1" />M'ãtsoo omɔ̃, onge bɛn embuul e baal bibi bvool éywɛn a bvi-adza, Yeso oti ayio a ndɛ mbel, bu alieel bɔ bubu: <verse eid="MRK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 8:2" />«Mɛ̃ ndi y'ãwua ã baal ba, ke ngwel wɛ emeesa ãtsoo ãtyel m'eli bɔ ye mɛ̃, kɛn a bɔ ki adza pyɛ. <verse eid="MRK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 8:3" />Ŋɛn mɛ̃ mveel bɔ ãnzɔ me nzal, bɔ ol'akab me nkuul, ke ngwel wɛ bibi onse bɔ afi lala.» <verse eid="MRK 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 8:4" />Ayio abveel ndɛ bubu: «Bvi-odza bvi eliil bɔ ayool, kwɛn ebɔɔ bvɛ onse ɔ̃baan wa kɛɛ-kɛɛ bubu?» <verse eid="MRK 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 8:5" />Yeso ofuul bɔ bubu: «Byɛ amampa kwɛ eli a bɔ?» Bɔ abveel bubu: «Nsiaan.» <verse eid="MRK 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 8:6" />Obobɔ, Yeso otam baal ndiri abva nsɛn me nsie. Ndɛ owel amampa ange-nsiaan, obveel Nziã ãtuɛɛn, otsiil bɔ, bu awi ayio a ndɛ, kwɛn bɔ akab baal bɔ. Bɔ bu asi obobɔ. <verse eid="MRK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 8:7" />Bɔ áli hɛ̃ y'ebe-baan bvi atswi ke kwɛ. Yeso obveel Nziã ãtuɛɛn me ndɔɔ answi obɔ, bu alieel ayio ndiri akab baal bɔ hɛ̃. <verse eid="MRK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 8:8" />Bɔ adzi ayool. Ayio abiri etsaka nsiaan tɔ m'etswel bvi esiil. <verse eid="MRK 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 8:9" />Ŋ'esa oŋɔ̃, baal áli nku-a-ku amiil anã (4.000). Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, Yeso obveel bɔ. <verse eid="MRK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 8:10" />Alili oŋɔ̃, ndɛ osam onse ebɛɛ y'ayio a ndɛ, bu ayɛn ke nsie yi Dalemanuta.<verse eid="MRK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Afalisaye abii emvieel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 8:11" />Afalisaye ayi, bu abvi otsuun ye Yeso. Bɔ alieel ndɛ ndiri asa emvieel ki esuo kwɛn ndɛ ofi ola Nziã. Bɔ alieel obobɔ, me ndɔɔ yi aywiin ndɛ bɛɛ. <verse eid="MRK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 8:12" />Yeso owel ɔ̃wuun ɔ̃yiĩ, bu ayɛɛn bubu: «Ndɔɔ mã yi ebebii baal ba lio li emvieel? Taa-taa bam, mɛ̃ eyɛɛn byɛ wɛn, k'eli y'emvieel ki asuo bɔ wɛ!» <verse eid="MRK 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 8:13" />Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, ndɛ osiil bɔ, bu ayɛn m'ebɛɛ ongwel a baã.<verse eid="MRK 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lebviil li Afalisaye ye li Elode</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 8:14" />Ayio adzɛɛn k'abiri amampa. Bɔ áli kɛn a ye mampa ngɔmɔ̃ onse ebɛɛ. <verse eid="MRK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 8:15" />Yeso bu alieel bɔ bubu: «Ekal y'onkyab! Ekal y'ãyal me ndɔɔ a lebviil li Afalisaye ye li Elode.» <verse eid="MRK 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 8:16" />Ayio bu abvi otsuun onse bam-a-bam me ndɔɔ yɛn bɔ k'áli y'amampa wɛ. <verse eid="MRK 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 8:17" />Yeso obɔɔ otsɛn, bu afuul bɔ bubu: «Ki ebetsuun byɛ wɛn byɛ k'eli y'amampa wɛ emã? Byɛ kɛn k'eyɛɛ wɛ? Byɛ kɛn ekwaal otsɛn wɛ? Byɛ y'ɛ̃kwal mpɛn eli? <verse eid="MRK 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 8:18" />Byɛ ye mviil, kɛn a byɛ k'emwɛn wɛ? Byɛ y'ãtswi, kɛn a byɛ k'eyoo wɛ? Emeeyeel, <verse eid="MRK 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 8:19" />me lio li ékab mɛ̃ amampa ataan m'amiil a baal ataan, byɛ etsaka atɔ-tɔ m'etswel bvi amampa kwɛ ébiri?» Bɔ abveel ndiri: «Etsaka kuun ye bviaal.» <verse eid="MRK 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 8:20" />«Bvool me lio li ékab mɛ̃ amampa ange-nsiaan me baal amiil anã (4.000), byɛ etsaka atɔ-tɔ m'etswel bvi amampa kwɛ ébiri?» Bɔ abveel ndiri: «Etsaka nsiaan.» <verse eid="MRK 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 8:21" />Yeso bu alieel bɔ bubu: «Byɛ kɛn ekwaal otsɛn wɛ?»<verse eid="MRK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso oboo ɔ̃nkwa-mviil ke Betesayida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 8:22" />Yeso y'ayio a ndɛ atɔ Betesayida. Oŋɔ̃, ayi ndɛ y'ɔ̃nkwa-mviil ngɔmɔ̃, bu aluɔɔn ndɛ k'abiɛɛn ndɛ. <verse eid="MRK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 8:23" />Yeso osiin ɔ̃nkwa-mviil ondɛ me kuɔɔl, opal onse ola, bu abiri ndɛ me pyɛ. Ndɛ okel ndɛ ãntɛɛ me mviil, ondɔɔl ndɛ mviɔɔl, bu afuul ndɛ ndiri: «Yɛ amwɛn eluɔ?» <verse eid="MRK 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 8:24" />Ndɛ odzweel mviil, bu ayɛɛn ndiri: «Mɛ̃ emwɛn baal, mɛ̃ emwɛn bɔ onge ɛ̃ti, kɛn a bɔ abedzuu.» <verse eid="MRK 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 8:25" />Yeso bvool ondɔɔl mviɔɔl nkal a mviil ã ndɛ, ŋ'edzweel ndɛ mviil, ndɛ omwɛn ngesɛ. Ndɛ obvuul, bu ayii amwɛn eluɔ bvieel kal-a-kal. <verse eid="MRK 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 8:26" />Yeso obveel ndɛ nzɔ y'ãyɛɛn m'ɔ̃nywã ndiri: «Kɔɔl ola yɛ, oyɛɛ ke bvool onse bviil wɛ.»<verse eid="MRK 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Piɛɛl oyɛɛn ndiri Yeso oli Mãsia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 8:27" />Yeso oyɛn y'ayio a ndɛ sua ãla mã tsotsoo a bviil li Tsedzale wa Filipe. Me nkuul, ndɛ ofuul bɔ bubu: «Baal abeyɛɛn ndiri mɛ̃ nã ndi?» <verse eid="MRK 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 8:28" />Bɔ abveel ndɛ bubu: «Bɛn abeyɛɛn ndiri yɛ li Dzaã Batis, bɛn ndiri yɛ li Eli, bɛn bvool ndiri yɛ li ngɔmɔ̃ onse aliaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã.» <verse eid="MRK 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 8:29" />Obobɔ, Yeso ofuul bɔ ndiri: «Ke byɛ, byɛ eyɛɛn wɛn mɛ̃ nã ndi?» Piɛɛl obveel ndɛ bubu: «Yɛ ndyam li Mãsia!» <verse eid="MRK 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 8:30" />Obobɔ, Yeso owi bɔ ãnkunkwa ndiri abee ndɔɔ oyɔ mbuul oliaal.<verse eid="MRK 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso oyɛɛn me ndɔɔ okwa y'osiool o ndɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 8:31" />Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, Yeso obvi bɔ oyiool ndiri ebvaan kwɛn Muaan a mbuul amwɛn fool bibi. Akuul-kuul y'amfam b'anga-a-Nziã y'ayiool b'ãngel àtiɔ ndɛ eboo, àbam ndɛ, bvool me tsoo li ãtyel, ndɛ àsiool. <verse eid="MRK 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 8:32" />Ndɛ olieel bɔ ndɔɔ oyɔ yam kal-a-kal. Obobɔ, Piɛɛl odzuru ndɛ me pyɛ, bu abvi ndɛ mbyel owa. <verse eid="MRK 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 8:33" />Kɛn a Yeso okɔɔl osɔɔn ayio, bu ayiaan Piɛɛl y'ãyɛɛn m'ɔ̃nywã ndiri: «Mbal ke mbee a mɛ̃, Satana! Ke ngwel wɛ, yɛ k'atsam m'emfa ki etsam Nziã wɛ, yɛ atsam m'emfa ki etsam baal.»<verse eid="MRK 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Emfa ki anɔɔn a Yeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 8:34" />Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, Yeso oti embuul e baal mbel y'ayio a ndɛ, bu alieel bɔ bueel bubu: «Okɛɛn mbuul odzii k'anɔɔn a mɛ̃, ebvaan kwɛn ndɛ abee omwiĩ o ndyam bvool obesiɔɔl. Yɔɔl kwɛn ndɛ abiri enkulusu e ndɛ bvool anɔɔn a mɛ̃. <verse eid="MRK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 8:35" />Ke ngwel wɛ, wu odzii k'abvuul omwiĩ o ndɛ, wu àywɛn a bɔ. Kɛn a wu àywɛn a omwiĩ o ndɛ me ndɔɔ a mɛ̃ bvool me ndɔɔ a Nsia yi Ngesɛ, wu àbvuul bɔ. <verse eid="MRK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 8:36" />Ŋɛn mbuul obɔɔ opfel b'ɔkiri a nsie ndyam wueel, bvel emã li obɔɔ ndɛ, okɛɛn ndɛ oywɛn a omwiĩ o ndɛ? <verse eid="MRK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 8:37" />Eluɔ emã kyɛn mbuul okoo k'awa ke mboo a omwiĩ o ndɛ? <verse eid="MRK 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 8:38" />Baal ba lio li ali anga-ãbi bvool k'akuru ãnzuru me Nziã wɛ. Okɛɛn mbuul oli y'opfuru o mɛ̃ ye b'ãyɛɛn ã mɛ̃ ke nkwel a baal obɔ, obobɔ, mɛ̃ wu Muaan a mbuul, ekieel ekal y'opfuru o ndɛ me lio li èya mɛ̃ onse lweel e tal a mɛ̃ y'ãnzwel m'ɔ̃nsensal.»<verse eid="MRK 8:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MRK 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 9:1" />Yeso olieel bɔ bvool bubu: «Taa-taa bam, mɛ̃ eyɛɛn byɛ wɛn, bakyɛ onse baal b'ali ŋã k'àkwa wɛ okɛɛn bɔ k'amwɛn k'eya Okwɛn o Nziã ye waan wɛ.»<verse eid="MRK 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso obuul</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 9:2" />Ke mbee ãtsoo ãsɛɛn, Yeso obiri Piɛɛl ye Dzak ye Dzaã, bu ayɛn ye bɔ me pyɛ nkal a nkio yi nda yi nda. Ke mviil ã bɔ, ndɛ obuul, <verse eid="MRK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 9:3" />ekɔ e ndɛ eyii enyɛɛn m'emfa kyɛn mbuul si-ekal ngɔmɔ̃ me nsie yam yueel k'akoo m'osuul ekɔ fuu obobɔ wɛ. <verse eid="MRK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 9:4" />Enseel oŋɔ̃, ayio ange-atyel amwɛn Eli ye Moyize abeta ɔ̃sam ye Yeso. <verse eid="MRK 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 9:5" />Piɛɛl abvuru oyɛɛn, olieel Yeso bubu: «Ɔ̃tee, eli ngesɛ kwɛn bia-byɛ ekal ŋã. Etuu asɛɛ atyel: Ngɔmɔ̃ wa yɛ, ngɔmɔ̃ wa Moyize, ngɔmɔ̃ wu Eli.» <verse eid="MRK 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 9:6" />Ke yam, Piɛɛl ãyal ã́fi, ke ngwel wɛ ndɛ y'ayio bakyɛ ebangɛɛ al'emeebɔɔ bɔ. <verse eid="MRK 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 9:7" />Epɛn eyefoo bɔ. Onse epɛn okɔ, nkii ngamɔ̃ eyɛɛn bubu: «Wu Muaan a mɛ̃ wu ɔ̃tio, eyoo ndɛ!» <verse eid="MRK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 9:8" />Alili oŋɔ̃, ayio atal nku-a-nku a bɔ, kɛn a bɔ k'abemwɛn mbuul wɛ, wu emwɛn bɔ kɛn a Yeso ndyam ɔ̃tu ye bɔ. <verse eid="MRK 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 9:9" />Ŋ'eyii ekwɛɛn bɔ nkio, Yeso owi bɔ ãnkunkwa ndiri abee mbuul si ɔ̃mɔ̃ m'emwɛn bɔ oliaal, tiil ye k'esiool Muaan a mbuul onse b'ákwi-ákwi. <verse eid="MRK 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 9:10" />Bɔ ayoo luo olɔ, kɛn a bɔ abvi ofuul bam-a-bam ndiri: «“Osiool onse b'ákwi-ákwi”, ŋ'ayɛɛn ndiri nki?» <verse eid="MRK 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 9:11" />Bɔ afuul Yeso bubu: «Me ndɔɔ emã ayiool b'ãngel abeyɛɛn ndiri: “Ebvaan kɛn ŋ'ɛ̃kwel Eli aya?”» <verse eid="MRK 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 9:12" />Yeso obveel bɔ bubu: «Ebvaan Eli aya kɛn ŋ'ɛ̃kwel me ndɔɔ yi ayebveel ãndɔɔ mbueel me nkuul. K'otsɛn omã hɛ̃ b'ákel me ndɔɔ Muaan a mbuul ndiri ebvaan kwɛn ndɛ amwɛn fool bibi bvool ndiri àfiɛɛn ndɛ? <verse eid="MRK 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 9:13" />Kɛn a mɛ̃ eyɛɛn byɛ wɛn, Eli amaaya bvool baal asi ndɛ onge b'edzii bɔ, onge b'ákel me ndɔɔ a ndɛ.»<verse eid="MRK 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso oboo muaan wu nkɛn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 9:14" />Ŋ'etɔ bɔ ol'ayio bakyɛ, bɔ amwɛn embuul e baal bibi edzii bɔ y'ayio b'ãngel abetsuun ye bɔ. <verse eid="MRK 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 9:15" />Ŋ'emwɛn baal Yeso, alili oŋɔ̃, esi bɔ bam bueel ɛ̃kam. Bɔ bu atsuu ntiin me ndɔɔ yi ayebio ndɛ. <verse eid="MRK 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 9:16" />Yeso ofuul bɔ bubu: «Ndɔɔ yi ebetsuun byɛ ye bɔ mã?» <verse eid="MRK 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 9:17" />Mbuul ngɔmɔ̃ onse baal obveel ndɛ bubu: «Ɔ̃tee, mɛ̃ ngya yɛ muaan a mɛ̃ wu bɔɔl, ke ngwel wɛ ndɛ oli y'ɔ̃fel wu ɔ̃bi-ɔ̃bi wu asuul ndɛ k'ayɛɛn wɛ. <verse eid="MRK 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 9:18" />Mboo mbi pyɛ, ɔ̃fel ondɛ asiin ndɛ, ndɛ osab ndɛ me nsie, oŋɔ̃ ndɛ ãfel ãyii ãpal onse ɔ̃nywã, obvi miin odza, bvool nzuru ewɛɛn mpɛn-mpɛn. Mɛ̃ nsɔɔ ayio a yɛ k'atswɛɛl ɔ̃fel ondɛ, kɛn a bɔ k'akoo wɛ.» <verse eid="MRK 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 9:19" />Yeso bu alieel bɔ bubu: «Byɛ baal ba lio li, byɛ eywɛn okiool! Mɛ̃ ye byɛ tiil mpwanki èkal? Mɛ̃ èkuru ɔ̃kwal me ndɔɔ a byɛ tiil lio emã? Eya mɛ̃ ye muaan.» <verse eid="MRK 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 9:20" />Ayi ndɛ ye muaan. Ŋ'emwɛn ndɛ Yeso, kɛn alili ɔŋɔ̃, ɔ̃fel wu ɔ̃bi-ɔ̃bi onziool ndɛ kokɔ, ndɛ obvi me nsie, bu ayii akɛɛn, ãfel ãpal onse ɔ̃nwyã. <verse eid="MRK 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 9:21" />Yeso bu afuul tal a ndɛ bubu: «Bɛɛn mpwa-nki ki ebesa ndɛ bubu?» Tal obveel bubu: «Fa obwee o ndɛ. <verse eid="MRK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 9:22" />Ãlio bibi, ɔ̃fel ondɛ abetsɛɛn ndɛ onse mbaa wuo onse ãdza me ndɔɔ yi abam ndɛ. Kɛn a yɛ okɛɛn koo k'asa k'emã, oŋɔ̃ sio bee nyiĩ bvool wuaal a bee!» <verse eid="MRK 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 9:23" />Yeso obveel ndɛ bubu: «Yɛ yɛɛn wɛn “okɛɛn yɛ koo”? Akoo k'asa mbueel me mbuul wa y'okiool!» <verse eid="MRK 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 9:24" />Kɛn a me lio olɔ, tal a muaan obiool ndiri: «Mɛ̃ nkiool, wuaal a mɛ̃, me ndɔɔ yɛn mɛ̃ ngywɛn a okiool!»<verse eid="MRK 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 9:25" />Ŋ'emwɛn Yeso k'eyii ebvɔɔn embuul tsotsoo a bɔ, ndɛ oyɛɛn ɔ̃fel wu ɔ̃bi-ɔ̃bi bubu: «Ɔ̃fel wu asuul mbuul nkɛn, mɛ̃ mbuul wu ntam yɛ wɛn, pal onse muaan wu bvool bee bam onse ndɛ obekɔɔl!» <verse eid="MRK 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 9:26" />Ɔfel bu apal onse muaan, akuaal ɛ̃sɔɔl bvool anziool ndɛ bam kokɔ. Muaan oyii onge wu okwi m'emfa kyɛn baal bibi abvi oyɛɛn ndiri: «Ndɛ ŋ'akwi.» <verse eid="MRK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 9:27" />Kɛn a Yeso osiin ndɛ me kuɔɔl otɛɛl ndɛ, ndɛ bu atɛɛn tɛ. <verse eid="MRK 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 9:28" />Ŋ'esam Yeso onse nzɔ bvool ŋ'emwɛn ayio kwɛn bɔ ayii kɛn a bam ye ndɛ, bɔ afuul ndɛ bubu: «Ndɔɔ mã yɛn bee k'ekoo m'otswɛɛl b'ɔ̃fel ondɛ wɛ?» <verse eid="MRK 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 9:29" />Yeso obveel bɔ bubu: «Ɛ̃fel mi bubu, ɛ̃bepal kɛn a m'ebuɛɛn.»<verse eid="MRK 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso oyɛɛn bo nsa yuaal me ndɔɔ okwa y'osiool o ndɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 9:30" />Bɔ ambal oŋɔ̃, bu atsiil nsie yi Ngalile. Yeso k'adzii kwɛn baal ayɛɛ mboo yi eli ndɛ wɛ. <verse eid="MRK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 9:31" />Ke ngwel wɛ, ndɛ ákeyiool ayio ãndɔɔ mã: «Muaan a mbuul, ŋ'ayii asa atiɔ ndɛ me mviɔɔl ɛ̃ baal, bɔ àbam ndɛ bvool me tsoo li ãtyel li ekwi ndɛ, ndɛ àsiool.» <verse eid="MRK 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 9:32" />Kɛn ayio k'ákebɔɔ otsɛn b'ãyɛɛn omɔ̃ wɛ, bɔ bvool áli ye buɔ b'afuul ndɛ ɛ̃fuul.<verse eid="MRK 9:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Wu onduru bakyɛ nã?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 9:33" />Bɔ atɔ Kapelanahum. Ŋ'etɔ bɔ nzɔ, Yeso ofuul ayio bubu: «Ndɔɔ yi eketsuun byɛ me nkuul-a-nkuul mã?» <verse eid="MRK 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 9:34" />Kɛn ayio awuun pi, ke ngwel wɛ me nkuul-a-nkuul, bɔ áketsuun onse bam-a-bam me ndɔɔ yi ayɛɛ wu onduru bakyɛ onse bɔ. <verse eid="MRK 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 9:35" />Obobɔ, Yeso obvi nsɛn, oti ayio ange-kuun ye buaal mbel, bu alieel bɔ bubu: «Okɛɛn mbuul odzii k'akal wu onduru bakyɛ, ebvaan ndɛ akal wa ke mbee a baal bueel bvool akal ɔ̃sal a baal bueel.» <verse eid="MRK 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 9:36" />Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, ndɛ owel muaan wu ɔ̃tsi-tsiri, osuul ndɛ ke nkwel a bɔ, oyɔɔ ndɛ onse mviɔɔl, bu alieel ayio bubu: <verse eid="MRK 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 9:37" />«Mbuul wu oyɔɔ muaan wɛn onge wu me nkuũ a mɛ̃, ŋ'ayɔɔ myam, bvool wu yɔɔ mɛ̃, ke mɛ̃ ayɔɔ wɛ, ndɛ ŋ'ayɔɔ wu oyuɔɔl mɛ̃.»<verse eid="MRK 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Wa bia-byɛ nã?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 9:38" />Dzaã olieel Yeso bubu: «Ɔ̃tee, bee emwɛn mbuul atswɛɛl ɛ̃fel mi ɛ̃bi-ɛ̃bi me nkuũ a yɛ, kɛn a bee ekedzii k'eluo ndɛ k'asa obobɔ, ke ngwel wɛ ndɛ k'ali onse nkel a bia-byɛ wɛ.» <verse eid="MRK 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 9:39" />Yeso obveel ndiri: «Ebee ndɛ oluo k'asa obobɔ, ke ngwel wɛ k'eli ye mbuul wɛ wɛn ŋ'esi ndɛ emvieel me nkuũ a mɛ̃, kɛn alili oŋɔ̃, obvi obi-obi oyɛɛn me ndɔɔ a mɛ̃. <verse eid="MRK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 9:40" />Ke ngwel wɛ, mbuul wɛn k'abyal bia-byɛ wɛ, ŋ'ali wa bia-byɛ. <verse eid="MRK 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 9:41" />Bvool mbuul wu owi byɛ mbiɔ a ãdza me ndɔɔ yɛn byɛ eli ba Mãsia, taa-taa bam, mɛ̃ eyɛɛn byɛ wɛn, ndɛ kieel k'akoo m'oywɛn ebvakab e ndɛ bam wɛ.»<verse eid="MRK 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ãndɔɔ m'ãbal baal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 9:42" />«Mbuul wu asa kwɛn ngɔmɔ̃ onse ebebaan bvi elɔɔ okiool onse mɛ̃ bvi ebva onse obi, ebvaan kwɛn akuru ndɛ nkɔɔn yi nɛn me nkii bvool atyal ndɛ onse ãdza m'ɔ̃ngwa. <verse eid="MRK 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 9:43" />Okɛɛn kuɔɔl e yɛ, ebal yɛ onse obi, tsiil kyɛ. Eli ngesɛ me ndɔɔ a yɛ k'asam onse elaã li ɔ̃bu kuɔɔl ngemɔ̃, ye k'ekal yɛ ye mviɔɔl ɛ̃nge-mviaal bvool ayi onse ywɛn e mbaa, ke mboo yɛn mbaa k'edzam wɛ. <verse eid="MRK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 9:44" />[ Okɔ mboo yɛn ɛ̃mfɛɛ̃ mi ɛ̃dza nzuru k'ɛ̃kwa wɛ bvool mbaa k'edzam wɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.44 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ndɔɔ yi k'ákel yɔ onse ɛ̃nkaan mi ɛ̃kyɛ mi tsɔɔn-tsɔɔn wɛ. </char></note>.] <verse eid="MRK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 9:45" />Okɛɛn kuul e yɛ ebal yɛ onse obi, tsiil kyɛ. Eli ngesɛ me ndɔɔ a yɛ k'asam onse elaã li ɔ̃bu kuul ngemɔ̃, ye k'ekal yɛ ye mviil ɛ̃nge-mviaal bvool ayi onse ywɛn e mbaa. <verse eid="MRK 9:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 9:46" />[Okɔ mboo yɛn ɛ̃mfɛɛ̃ mi ɛ̃dza nzuru k'ɛ̃kwa wɛ bvool mbaa k'edzam wɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.46 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ndɔɔ yi k'ákel yɔ onse ɛ̃nkaan mi ɛ̃kyɛ mi tsɔɔn-tsɔɔn wɛ.</char></note>.] <verse eid="MRK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 9:47" />Okɛɛn dziil e yɛ ebal yɛ onse obi, mbaal lɔ. Eli ngesɛ me ndɔɔ a yɛ k'asam onse Okwɛn o Nziã dziil ngemɔ̃, ye k'ekal yɛ ye mviil ãnge-mbuaal bvool atyal yɛ onse ywɛn e mbaa. <verse eid="MRK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 9:48" />Okɔ mboo yɛn ɛ̃mfɛɛ̃ mi ɛ̃dza nzuru k'ɛ̃kwa wɛ bvool mbaa k'edzam wɛ. <verse eid="MRK 9:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 9:49" />Ke ngwel wɛ, Nziã akieel alɔ mbaa onse mbuul ndyam wueel onge b'elɔ baal ɔ̃ngwa onse bvi-odza.»<verse eid="MRK 9:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 9:50" />«Ɔ̃ngwa oli eluɔ ki bvɛ, kɛn okɛɛn ɔ̃ngwa oywɛn obvie o ndɛ, emfa emã kyɛn byɛ ol'ebveel ndɛ bɔ? Ekal y'ɔ̃ngwa onse byam bvool ekal onse opi ye bakyɛ.»<verse eid="MRK 9:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MRK 10" />
  <para style="s1">Okwa o bal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 10:1" />Ŋ'embal Yeso oŋɔ̃, ndɛ oyɛn k'etswi e nsie ki Yude bvool oyɛn ongwel a nzal yi Dzolodɛ̃. Embuul bvool eyedzii ndɛ, ndɛ bu abvi bɔ oyiool onge b'ebesa ndɛ tsɔɔn. <verse eid="MRK 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 10:2" />Afalisaye ke kwɛ asyel tsotsoo a ndɛ, me ndɔɔ yi aywiin ndɛ bɛɛ m'ɔ̃mfuul wu: «Ngel a bia-byɛ ewa bɔɔl nkuul yi abee ɔ̃kal a ndɛ?» <verse eid="MRK 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 10:3" />Yeso obveel bɔ m'ɔ̃mfuul wu: «Ngel yi éwi Moyize byɛ mã?» <verse eid="MRK 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 10:4" />Bɔ ayɛɛn bubu: «Moyize áwi ngel yɛn bɔɔl m'obee b'ɔ̃kal obvie owi ndɛ ɔ̃nkaan wu okwa o bal, me ndɔɔ yi ambaal ndɛ ke bal.» <verse eid="MRK 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 10:5" />Obobɔ, Yeso olieel bɔ bubu: «Okɛɛn Moyize ákel byɛ ngel oyɔ, eli me ndɔɔ ɛ̃tswɛ mpɛn ɛ̃ byɛ. <verse eid="MRK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 10:6" />Kɛn a k'obɛɛn, ŋ'ési Nziã ɔ̃nkiri, “ndɛ ási bɔ bɔɔl y'ɔ̃kaal.” <verse eid="MRK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 10:7" />“Obɔ otsɛn bɛn bɔɔl akieel ambal ola tal ye ngoo a ndɛ, me ndɔɔ yi akuru nzruru m'ɔ̃kal a ndɛ, <verse eid="MRK 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 10:8" />obobɔ, bɔ ange-buaal akal nzuru ngamɔ̃.” M'emfa okyɛ, bɔ k'abekal baal buaal wɛ, ayii onge mbuul ngɔmɔ̃. <verse eid="MRK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 10:9" />Oŋɔ̃ yɔɔl kwɛn b'ebvool Nziã, mbuul abee bɔ otsal.»<verse eid="MRK 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 10:10" />Ŋ'etɔ bɔ nzɔ, ayio bvool afuul Yeso ɛ̃mfuul me ndɔɔ a ndɔɔ oyɔ. <verse eid="MRK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 10:11" />Ndɛ obveel bɔ bubu: «Ŋɛn mbuul obee ɔ̃kal a ndɛ bvool oyebaal ɔ̃kal ɔ̃nkyam, ndɛ ŋ'afel ngel a bal ol'ɔ̃kal wu ɛ̃kwel. <verse eid="MRK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 10:12" />Emfa kiki hɛ̃, ŋɛn ɔ̃kaal obee ɔ̃lam a ndɛ bvool oyebaal ɔ̃lam ɔ̃nkyam, ndɛ ŋ'afel ngel a bal.»<verse eid="MRK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso ye baan b'atsi-atsi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 10:13" />Baal abiri baan b'atsi-atsi ola Yeso, me ndɔɔ yɛn ndɛ andɔɔl bɔ kuɔɔl, kɛn ayio ayiaan baal obɔ. <verse eid="MRK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 10:14" />Ŋ'emwɛn Yeso obobɔ, ndɛ oyoo nkiee, bu alieel bɔ bubu: «Eyɔɔl baan b'atsi-atsi aya ola mɛ̃, ebee bɔ nkuul okii, ke ngwel wɛ Okwɛn o Nziã oli bo baal b'ali onge bɔ. <verse eid="MRK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 10:15" />Taa-taa bam, mɛ̃ eyɛɛn byɛ wɛn, mbuul okɛɛn k'ayɔɔ Okwɛn o Nziã onge muaan wu ɔ̃tsi-ɔ̃tsi wɛ, k'àsam bɔ bam wɛ.» <verse eid="MRK 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 10:16" />Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, Yeso obuun baan onse mviɔɔl ɛ̃ ndɛ, ondɔɔl bɔ kuɔɔl m'osɔɔ ola Nziã k'asa bɔ ongesɛ.<verse eid="MRK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso y'ɔ̃pfel ngɔmɔ̃</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 10:17" />Me lio lɛn Yeso oyii otwal nkuul yi ayi, bɔɔl ngelemɔ̃ eyi me ntiin, bu ebvi ãbuo ke nkwel a ndɛ, me ndɔɔ yi afuul ndɛ ndiri: «Ɔ̃tee wu ɔ̃mvɛ, ki esa mɛ̃ emã me ndɔɔ yi ebɔɔ elaã li ɔ̃bu nkal ɔ̃bu?» <verse eid="MRK 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 10:18" />Yeso obveel ndɛ bubu: «Ndɔɔ mã yi eta yɛ mɛ̃ wɛn mbuul wu ɔ̃bvɛ? Mbuul wu ɔ̃bvɛ k'ali wɛ, wu ɔ̃mvɛ kɛn a Nziã ndyam. <verse eid="MRK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 10:19" />Yɛ ndoo yɛɛ ãngel mã: “Oyɛɛ ke bam mbuul wɛ. Oyɛɛ ke dzuu y'ɔ̃kal wuo y'ɔ̃lam a mbuul wɛ. Oyɛɛ ke turu eluɔ e mbuul wɛ. Oyɛɛ ke buru mbuul ndɔɔ wɛ. Oyɛɛ ke sa mbuul obi wɛ. Lweel tal ye ngoo a yɛ.”» <verse eid="MRK 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 10:20" />Mbuul ondɛ obveel ndiri: «Ɔ̃tee, mɛ̃ ebekiaal ãngel omɔ̃ mbueel fa obwee o mɛ̃.» <verse eid="MRK 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 10:21" />Yeso otal ndɛ ye dzii lueel, bu alieel ndɛ bubu: «Eywɛn yɛ ndɔɔ ngamɔ̃: Yi, tiɔ eluɔ bvieel bvi eli a yɛ bvool wa nzi oyɔ aywal, obobɔ yɛ abɔɔ opfel ke ywel. Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, ya bvool nɔɔ̃n a mɛ̃.» <verse eid="MRK 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 10:22" />Kɛn a ŋ'eyoo mbuul ondɛ obobɔ, ndɛ mwiil ãpiin, bu ayɛn y'ãwua bibi, ke ngwel wɛ ndɛ áli y'obɔɔ bibi. <verse eid="MRK 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 10:23" />Yeso otal ngwel-a-ngwel, bu alieel ayio a ndɛ ndiri: «Eli ye fool me b'ali y'opfel k'asam onse Okwɛn o Nziã!» <verse eid="MRK 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 10:24" />Ayio ebaangɛ ebɔɔ ŋ'eyoo bɔ ãyɛɛn omɔ̃. Kɛn a Yeso bvool olieel bɔ bubu: «Baan a mɛ̃, eli ye fool m'osam onse Okwɛn o Nziã! <verse eid="MRK 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 10:25" />Eli ye fool kwɛn nyam wu ɔ̃mbiri ãpfuũ wu ata me swamo abwel onse pfee e nyuɔ̃. Kɛn osam b'ɔ̃pfel Okwɛn o Nziã, oyɔ ndɔɔ yi enduru fool yam.» <verse eid="MRK 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 10:26" />Ayio bvool ebaangɛ bu elɔɔ, bɔ bu abvi ofuul bam-a-bam ndiri: «Ke m'emfa okyɛ, wɛn ol'obvuul nã?» <verse eid="MRK 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 10:27" />Yeso otal bɔ bvool olieel bɔ bubu: «Ãndɔɔ mɛn baal k'akoo k'asa wɛ, Nziã asa mɔ̃, ke ngwel wɛ Nziã yi akwɛɛn pyɛ.» <verse eid="MRK 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 10:28" />Obobɔ, Piɛɛl olieel ndɛ bubu: «Meyoo! Bee bam esiil eluɔ bvieel, me ndɔɔ yi eluɛɛn a yɛ.» <verse eid="MRK 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 10:29" />Yeso obveel bubu: «Taa-taa bam, mɛ̃ eyɛɛn byɛ wɛn, mbuul wueel wɛn me ndɔɔ a mɛ̃ bvool me ndɔɔ a Nsia yi Ngesɛ, osiil nzɔ a ndɛ, baan-ngoo a ndɛ b'abɔɔl ye b'akaal, ngoo a ndɛ, tal a ndɛ, baan a ndɛ, ãnguun ã ndɛ, <verse eid="MRK 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 10:30" />ndɛ akieel abɔɔ me lio li, nsa ɔ̃nkam (100), ãnzɔ, baan-ngoo b'abɔɔl ye b'akaal, angoo, baan, y'ãnguun, y'omwɛn o fool hɛ̃, me ndɔɔ a mɛ̃. Onse ɔ̃kiri wu aya, ndɛ akieel abɔɔ elaã li ɔ̃bu. <verse eid="MRK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 10:31" />Baal bibi ba nkwel akieel akal ba mbee, bvool baal bibi ba mbee akieel akal ba nkwel.»<verse eid="MRK 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso oyɛɛn li nsa tyel m'okwa y'osiool ondɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 10:32" />Ŋ'éli bɔ me nkuul k'abeyi Yelusalem, Yeso ákedzuu ke nkwel a bɔ. Ayio áli y'ãwua bvool b'ákeyi bɔ osuul áli ye buɔ. Yeso bvool obiri antam ange-kuun ye buaal me pyɛ, bu abvi bɔ ãndɔɔ m'ãyeya me ndɛ oliaal. <verse eid="MRK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 10:33" />Ndɛ olieel bɔ bubu: «Eyoo! Bia-byɛ ŋ'ebeyi Yelusalem, okɔ àtiɔ Muaan a mbuul m'amfam b'angaa-a- Nziã y'ayiool b'ãngel. Bɔ àwa ndɛ etumbu ki epfu bvool àtiɔ ndɛ me mviɔɔl ɛ̃ baal b'ɛ̃kiri ɛ̃kyam. <verse eid="MRK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 10:34" />Bɔ àsɔɔl ndɛ, àfaan ndɛ ãtɛɛ, àbɛɛl ndɛ asikɔrɔ bvool àbam ndɛ. Kɛn a me tsoo li ãtyel, ndɛ àsiool onse b'ákwi-ákwi.»<verse eid="MRK 10:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ki esɔɔ Dzak ye Dzaã</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 10:35" />Obobɔ, Dzak ye Dzaã, baan a Dzebede ayi tsotsoo a Yeso. Bɔ alieel ndɛ bubu: «Ɔ̃tee, bee edzii kwɛn yɛ sa bee ndɔɔ yi èsɔɔ bee yɛ.» <verse eid="MRK 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 10:36" />Yeso ofuul bɔ bubu: «Ki edzii byɛ kwɛn me nsa byɛ emã?» <verse eid="MRK 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 10:37" />Bɔ abveel ndɛ ndiri: «Me lio li ekieel èkal yɛ onse lweel e yɛ, suul kwɛn bee ebva nsɛn tsotsoo a yɛ, wɛn me nkuɔɔl e yɛ ki elam, wɛn me ki ekal.» <verse eid="MRK 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 10:38" />Kɛn a Yeso oyɛɛn bɔ ndiri: «Byɛ k'eyɛɛ ndɔɔ yi esɔɔ byɛ wɛ. Byɛ ekoo m'onywa mbiɔ yi fool yi èyenywa mɛ̃? Byɛ ekoo k'ewal opongo b'èyewal mɛ̃?» <verse eid="MRK 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 10:39" />Bɔ abveel ndɛ ndiri: «Bee ol'ekoo.» Yeso olieel bɔ bubu: «Byɛ ènywa mbiɔ yi fool yi ènywa mɛ̃ ndyam, bvool byɛ èwal opongo b'èwal mɛ̃. <verse eid="MRK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 10:40" />Kɛn a me b'otal obva o nsɛn me kuɔɔl e mɛ̃ ki elam wuo ki ekal, wu atsiil ndɔɔ oyɔ ke mɛ̃ wɛ, ãmboo omɔ̃ ãli mã baal b'éyɛɛl Nziã bɔ mɔ̃.» <verse eid="MRK 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 10:41" />Ŋ'eyoo ayio kuun b'asiil ãndɔɔ omɔ̃, bɔ ayoo nkyee ye Dzak bwɛn a Dzaã. <verse eid="MRK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 10:42" />Obobɔ, Yeso oti bɔ mbel, bu alieel bɔ bubu: «Byɛ eyɛɛ kwɛn, b'ebewal baal onge amfam b'ɛ̃kiri atuaal baal a bɔ mpal, baal b'anɛn hɛ̃ abenyam ɛ̃kiri ɛ̃ bɔ m'onyam. <verse eid="MRK 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 10:43" />Kɛn a yɔɔl kwɛn ebee obobɔ okal onse byɛ. Mbuul wu odzii k'anduru bakyɛ onse byɛ, àkal ɔ̃sal a byɛ. <verse eid="MRK 10:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 10:44" />Bvool mbuul wu odzii k'akal wu ɛ̃kwel onse byɛ, àkal ɔ̃nkyal a byɛ. <verse eid="MRK 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 10:45" />Ke ngwel wɛ, Muaan a mbuul k'ayi me ndɔɔ yɛn baal asal me ndɔɔ a ndɛ wɛ, ndɛ oyi me ndɔɔ yi asal me ndɔɔ a baal bvool me ndɔɔ yi awa elaã e ndɛ onge ɔ̃bvɛn wu afuru, me ndɔɔ yi abvuul ɔ̃bɔbɔ a baal.»<verse eid="MRK 10:45" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso oboo Baatime wu ɔ̃nkwa-mviil</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 10:46" />Yeso y'ayio a ndɛ atɔ bviil li Yeliko. Ŋ'epal bɔ onse bviil olɔ y'embuul e baal bibi, ɔ̃nkwa-mviil ngɔmɔ̃ wɛn nkuũ Baatime, wu muaan a Time, áli me nsɛn nku-a-nku a nkuul, me ndɔɔ yi abelaa eluɔ. <verse eid="MRK 10:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 10:47" />Ŋ'eyoo ndɛ ndiri wu abebwel eli Yeso wa Nadzalet, ndɛ obvi obiool bubu: «Yeso, Muaan a David, sio mɛ̃ nyiĩ!» <verse eid="MRK 10:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 10:48" />Kɛn a baal bibi abvi ndɛ opɛɛn ndiri: «Suul nkyal!» Kɛn a ndɛ obiool bam kokɔ ndiri: «Muaan a David, sio mɛ̃ nyiĩ!» <verse eid="MRK 10:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 10:49" />Yeso otɛɛn, bu alieel bubu: «Eta ndɛ mbel!» Baal ati ɔ̃nkwa-mviil mbel ndiri: «Sa mpɛn, tɛɛn, ndɛ oti yɛ mbel!» <verse eid="MRK 10:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 10:50" />Obobɔ, ndɛ oti kazaka o ndɛ pfɛɛ, obiri kab, bu ayɛn ola Yeso. <verse eid="MRK 10:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 10:51" />Yeso ofuul ndɛ bubu: «Ndɔɔ mã y'edzii yɛ kwɛn mɛ̃ nsa yɛ?» Ɔ̃nkwa-mviil obveel ndɛ bubu: «Ɔ̃tee, sa kwɛn mɛ̃ bvool mwɛn.» <verse eid="MRK 10:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 10:52" />Yeso olieel ndɛ bubu: «Yi, okiool o yɛ obvuul yɛ!» Kɛn alili oŋɔ̃, ɔ̃nkwa-mviil obvi omwɛn bvool, ndɛ bu abvi Yeso oluɛɛn me nkuul.<verse eid="MRK 10:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MRK 11" />
  <para style="s1">Osam o Yeso Yelusalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 11:1" />Ŋ'eyii ebiɔɔn bɔ Yelusalem, tsotsoo ola bo Betefadzwe ye bo Betani sua nkio a ɛ̃ti mi Olibve, Yeso oyuɔɔl baal buaal onse ayio a ndɛ, <verse eid="MRK 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 11:2" />ndiri: «Eyi onse ola b'oli ke nkwel a byɛ ba. Kɛn a ŋ'èsam byɛ onse bɔ, byɛ èmwɛn muaan a nyam wu ata me ane wu akuru me swɛ wɛn mbuul lɔɔ-okal kɛn anɔɔn nkal a ndɛ wɛ. Enyiɔɔn ndɛ, eya ye ndɛ. <verse eid="MRK 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 11:3" />Okɛɛn mbuul ofuul byɛ ndiri: “Otsɛn omã b'esa byɛ obobɔ?”, eliaal ndɛ wɛn: “Mfam oli ye kɔɔ e ndɛ, obobɔ ndɛ àyuɔɔl ndɛ ŋã alili oŋɔ̃.”» <verse eid="MRK 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 11:4" />Ayio bu ayɛn. Bɔ amwɛn muaan a ane onkwel-a-nzi m'okuru tsotsoo ɔ̃nywã a nzɔ ngamɔ̃. Bɔ bu anyiɔɔn ndɛ. <verse eid="MRK 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 11:5" />Baal ke kwɛ onse b'áli oŋɔ̃ afuul bɔ ndiri: «Byɛ emã ebesa? Otsɛn omã b'enyiɔɔn byɛ muaan a ane ondɛ?» <verse eid="MRK 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 11:6" />Bɔ abveel onge b'élieel Yeso, obobɔ ayɔɔl bɔ ayɛn. <verse eid="MRK 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 11:7" />Bɔ abiri muaan a ane ola Yeso, andɔɔl ɛ̃nkuru ɛ̃ bɔ nkal ɔ̃nguo a ndɛ. Yeso bu anɔɔn nkal a ndɛ. <verse eid="MRK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 11:8" />Baal bibi ayel ekɔ e bɔ nkal a nkuul, bvool bakyɛ ayel nsuɛɛn yi ãba yi etsiil bɔ onse ãnguun. <verse eid="MRK 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 11:9" />Baal b'ákedzuu ke nkwel a Yeso ye b'ákenɔɔn a ndɛ ákebiool bubu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 11:9">«Odzana!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 11:9">Yɔɔl kwɛn wu aya me nkuũ a Mfam akal y'ondɔɔl o kuɔɔl!<verse eid="MRK 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 11:10" />Yɔɔl kwɛn Nziã andɔɔl okwɛn b'oya kuɔɔl,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 11:10">okwɛn o David wu nkiɔɔn a bia-byɛ!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 11:10">Odzana ola Nziã wa ke ywel!»<verse eid="MRK 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 11:11" />Yeso osam Yelusalem, bu ayɛn Nzɔ a Nziã. Ke mbee a ŋ'etal ndɛ mbueel m'ákebwel onse oŋɔ̃, ndɛ opal, bu ayɛn Betani y'ayio ange-kuun ye buaal, ke ngwel wɛ tal al'emeyel.<verse eid="MRK 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔ̃ti wa fig wɛn k'aburu nsia wɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 11:12" />Ela esiool, me lio li eyii epal bɔ onse Betani, Yeso eyoo nzal. <verse eid="MRK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 11:13" />Ndɛ otaal ɔ̃ti wa fig lala y'ãsɔɔ̃. Ndɛ bu ayɛn ayetal owɛɛl ndɛ oli ye nsia, kɛn a ŋ'etɔ ndɛ tsotsoo ɔ̃ti, ndɛ omwɛn kɛn ãsɔɔ̃, ke ngwel wɛ, k'éli ɔ̃bvu wu afig wɛ. <verse eid="MRK 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 11:14" />Obobɔ Yeso olieel ɔ̃ti wa fig bubu: «Mbuul bvool wu abedza nsia e yɛ pyɛ!» Ayio a ndɛ ayoo ãyɛɛn omɔ̃.<verse eid="MRK 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso onse Nzɔ a Nziã</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 11:15" />Bɔ atɔ Yelusalem. Yeso osam onse Nzɔ a Nziã, bu abvi baal b'áketiɔ ye b'ákesuun otswɛɛl onse okɔ. Ndɛ otsal amisa a b'ákeswɛɛl nzi y'ãkiri ã b'áketiɔ ãkuun, <verse eid="MRK 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 11:16" />bvool ndɛ k'awi nkuul kwɛn mbuul apal y'eluɔ si ngemɔ̃ onse Nzɔ̃ a Nziã wɛ. <verse eid="MRK 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 11:17" />Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, ndɛ oyiool bɔ bubu: «Onse Ɔ̃nkaan a Nziã, Nziã oyɛɛn bubu: “ Nzɔ a mɛ̃, àta yɔ me nzɔ a ãbuɛɛn me ndɔɔ ãyam mbueel.” Kɛn a byɛ, byɛ emeekaal yɔ eyii mboo yi edziɔɔn anga-pfuul!» <verse eid="MRK 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 11:18" />Anga-a-Nziã b'anɛn y'ayiool b'ãngel ayoo ãndɔɔ omɔ̃ bvool ayii abii ãyal m'abam ndɛ, me ndɔɔ yɛn bɔ áli ye buɔ o ndɛ, ke ngwel wɛ embuul e baal kieel ékekam m'ãtee ã ndɛ. <verse eid="MRK 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 11:19" />Ŋ'etɔ ãnkunkwa, Yeso y'ayio a ndɛ apal onse Yelusalem.<verse eid="MRK 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso y'ɔ̃ti a fig wu okɛɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 11:20" />Epal-e-pal, ŋ'eyii ebwel ayio m'olɔ, bɔ amwɛn ɔ̃ti wa fig amakɛɛ fa ɛ̃dza ɛ̃ ndɛ. <verse eid="MRK 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 11:21" />Piɛɛl oyeel ãndɔɔ m'ãbwel, bu alieel Yeso ndiri: «Ɔ̃tee, tal ɔ̃ti wa fig wu ebwel yɛ enkɛɛ wu amaakɛɛ ndyam wueel!» <verse eid="MRK 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 11:22" />Yeso bu alieel ayio a ndɛ bubu: «Ekal y'okiool me Nziã! <verse eid="MRK 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 11:23" />Taa-taa bam, mɛ̃ eyɛɛn byɛ wɛn, ŋɛn mbuul olieel nkio yi ndiri: “Mbal oŋɔ̃, yi y'atyal nzuru onse ãdza m'ɔ̃ngwa”, bvool okɛɛn ndɛ k'asi enkyam onse ɔ̃kwal a ndɛ wɛ, kɛn a ndɛ okiool ndiri m'eyɛɛn ndɛ, àsa mɔ̃, àsa mɔ̃ hɛ̃ me ndɔɔ a ndɛ. <verse eid="MRK 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 11:24" />Obɔ otsɛn bɛn, mɛ̃ eyɛɛn byɛ wɛn, eluɔ kieel ki èsɔɔ byɛ onse ãbuɛɛn, ekiool wɛn byɛ emeebɔɔ kyɛ, obobɔ àwa byɛ kyɛ. <verse eid="MRK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 11:25" />Bvool okɛɛn byɛ eli tɛ me ndɔɔ yi ebuɛɛn, okɛɛn byɛ eli ye ndɔɔ ye mbuul, edzeel ndɛ, me ndɔɔ yɛn Tal a byɛ wu oli ke ywel adzeel obi b'esi byɛ hɛ̃. [<verse eid="MRK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 11:26" />Kɛn a ŋɛn byɛ k'edzeel bakyɛ wɛ, Tal a byɛ wu oli ke ywel k'adzeel byɛ obi b'esi byɛ hɛ̃ wɛ.]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ndɔɔ yi, k'ákel yɔ onse ɛ̃nkaan mikyɛ mi tsɔɔn-tsɔɔn wɛ.</char></note>»<verse eid="MRK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okwɛn o Yeso kwɛn ofi?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 11:27" />Bɔ ayebvool Yelusalem. Me lio lɛn Yeso oyi akɔɔl onse Nzɔ a Nziã, angaa-a-Nziã b'anɛn y'ayiool b'ãngel y'akuu-kuul ayebɔɔ ndɛ. <verse eid="MRK 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 11:28" />Bɔ afuul ndɛ bubu: «Okwɛn b'ebesa yɛ ãndɔɔ mã bo nã? Wu owi yɛ okwɛn b'asa mɔ̃ nã?» <verse eid="MRK 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 11:29" />Yeso obveel bɔ bubu: «Mɛ̃ èfuul byɛ ɔ̃mfuul ndyam ngɔ̃mɔ̃: Ŋɛn byɛ ewi mɛ̃ ɔ̃mbveel, oŋɔ̃ mɛ̃ bu ndieel byɛ okwɛn b'ebesa mɛ̃ ãndɔɔ mã. <verse eid="MRK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 11:30" />Wu áyuɔɔl Dzaã me ndɔɔ yi awa baal opongo nã, Nziã wuo Baal? Ewa mɛ̃ ɔ̃mveel.» <verse eid="MRK 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 11:31" />Kɛn a bɔ abvi otsuun bam-a-bam ndiri: «Bia-byɛ ebveel wɛn “Nziã wu áyuɔɔl ndɛ”, ndɛ mpii ol'ofuul bia-byɛ ndiri: “Ke byɛ ébee ndɛ okiool emã?” <verse eid="MRK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 11:32" />Kɛn a ŋɛn bia-byɛ ebveel ndɛ wɛn: “Wu áyuɔɔl ndɛ baal...”» Bɔ áli ye buɔ b'embuul, ke ngwel wɛ bueel ákekiool ndiri Dzaã oli ɔ̃liaal-ɛ̃nkiɛɛn a Nziã wa taa-taa. <verse eid="MRK 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 11:33" />Obobɔ, bɔ abveel Yeso ndiri: «Bee k'eyɛɛ wɛ.» Yeso bu abveel bɔ ndiri: «Mɛ̃ ndyam hɛ̃ k'eliaal byɛ okwɛn b'ebesa mɛ̃ ãndɔɔ mã wɛ.»<verse eid="MRK 11:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MRK 12" />
  <para style="s1">Mboo asal a nguun a bvine</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 12:1" />Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, Yeso obvi oyɛɛn ye bɔ m'ãmboo. Ndɛ oti bɔ mboo yi: «Mbuul ngɔmɔ̃ ákwɛn nguun a bvine. Ndɛ odzii yɔ ekɔɔ, otsam ywɛn onse yɔ me ndɔɔ yi akɛɛl nsia, bvool otuu nzɔ yi nkal a ywel yi ekal ɔ̃nkiaal. Ndɛ obuun yɔ m'asal a bvine, kwɛn bɔ abefuru ndɛ. Ndɛ bu ayɛn dzwɛ. <verse eid="MRK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 12:2" />Ŋ'ekoo lio li aka nsia, ndɛ oyuɔɔl ɔ̃sal ngɔmɔ̃ ol'asal ba ke nguun, kwɛn bɔ awa boo e bvine li ndɛ. <verse eid="MRK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 12:3" />Kɛn asal a nguun a bvine ayiool nkal ɔ̃sal o ndɛ, abɛɛl ndɛ bu abveel ndɛ ãkɛ-ãkɛɛ. <verse eid="MRK 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 12:4" />Ndɛ bvool oyuɔɔl bɔ ɔ̃sal ɔ̃kyam, ondɛ, bɔ abɛɛl m'ɔ̃tswɛ bvool aswel ɛ̃tswɛ. <verse eid="MRK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 12:5" />Ndɛ oyuɔɔl ɔ̃sal wu atyel, ondɛ, bɔ abam. Ndɛ bvool oyuɔɔl asal akyam bibi, babyɛ bɔ abɛɛl, babyɛ bɔ abam. <verse eid="MRK 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 12:6" />Nga-nguun bu asiil kɛn a me muaan a ndyam ngɔmɔ̃ wu ɔ̃tio. Ndɛ oyuɔɔl bɔ ndɛ ke mbee asal bueel y'ãtsam mã: “Bɔ ol'àwel muaan a myam ye bvɛɛ!” <verse eid="MRK 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 12:7" />Kɛn asal a nguun a bvine ayɛɛn bam-a-bam bubu: “Etal wu akieel awal ɔ̃swal! Eya, ebam ndɛ, kwɛn ɔ̃swal akal wa bia-byam!” <verse eid="MRK 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 12:8" />Obobɔ, bɔ asiin ndɛ, abam ndɛ, bu atyel ndɛ ongwel a nguun a bvine.<verse eid="MRK 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 12:9" />Ke nga-nguun a bvine bwɛn asa? Ndɛ àya, àtam k'abam asal obɔ, bvool àwa nguun m'asal akyam. <verse eid="MRK 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 12:10" />Byɛ lɔɔ-okal kɛn etsiɔ m'ákel onse ɔ̃nkaan a Nziã mã wɛ:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:10">“Nkɔɔn yi éti atuu pfɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:10">eyii nkɔɔn yi nkiin yi nzɔ.<verse eid="MRK 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 12:11" />Ndɔɔ oyɔ efi ola Mfam,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:11">yɔ eli ndɔɔ yi ɛ̃kam ke mviil ã bia-byɛ<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:22-23">Ãnz 118.22-23</ref></char></note>!”»<verse eid="MRK 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 12:12" />Amfam b'Ayuda ákebii ãyal m'asiin Yeso, kɛn a bɔ áli ye buɔ b'embuul. Bɔ ayɛɛ ndiri ndɛ mboo oyɔ me bɔ áti. Obobɔ, bɔ asiil ndɛ, bu ayɛn.<verse eid="MRK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mpal yi afuru ɔ̃kwɛn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 12:13" />Amfam b'Ayuda ayuɔɔl Afalisaye ye baal ke kwɛ ba nkel a Elode ola Yeso, me ndɔɔ yi aywiin ndɛ bɛɛ m' ɔ̃mfuul. <verse eid="MRK 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 12:14" />Bɔ ayeliaal ndɛ bubu: «Ɔ̃tee, bee eyɛɛ kwɛn yɛ abeliaal otaa-taa bvool ke li ye buɔ o mbuul wɛ, ke ngwel wɛ yɛ ke li y'ɔ̃bɛɛ wɛ. Kɛn a yɛ abeyiool baal nkuul a Nziã onse otaa-taa bueel. Oŋɔ̃ meliaal bee bam b'etsam yɛ me ndɔɔ yi: Awi baal nkuul yi afuru mpaa yi ɔ̃kwɛn Sedzaal, wuo k'awi yɔ wɛ?» <verse eid="MRK 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 12:15" />Kɛn a Yeso wu ayɛɛ ãtsam ã bɔ m'ãbi, obveel bɔ bubu: «Ki eywiin byɛ mɛ̃ bɛɛ emã? Eyiaal mɛ̃ nzi yi ãbvieel ngamɔ̃ yi abefuru mpal kwɛn mɛ̃ ntal yɔ.» <verse eid="MRK 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 12:16" />Bɔ ayi ndɛ ye nzi yi ãbvieel ngamɔ̃. Ndɛ bu afuul bɔ bubu: «Osu ba bo nã? Nkuũ yi nã?» Bɔ abveel ndɛ ndiri: «Osu bo Sedzaal, nkuũ hɛ̃ yi Sedzaal.» <verse eid="MRK 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 12:17" />Yeso bu alieel bɔ ndiri: «Eluɔ bvi Sedzaal, ewa Sedzaal, bvi Nziã, ewa Nziã.» Ŋ'eyoo bɔ ɔ̃mveel ondɛ, esi bɔ ɛ̃kam bibi.<verse eid="MRK 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔ̃mfuul me ndɔɔ osiool o b'akwi-akwi</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 12:18" />Obobɔ, Asaduseyɛ̃ ayi ola Yeso. Bɔ baal bɛn k'abekiool kwɛn b'ákwi-ákwi akieel asiool wɛ. Bɔ afuul Yeso bubu: <verse eid="MRK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 12:19" />«Ɔ̃tee, Moyize ákel ndiri: “Ŋɛn bɔɔl okwi osiil ɔ̃kal wɛn bɔ k'abɔɔ muaan wɛ, muaan-ngoo a ndɛ àwal ɔ̃pfiil, kwɛn bɔ abuo esii e baal me nkuũ a ɔ̃pfu<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 25:5-6">Det 25.5-6</ref></char></note>.” <verse eid="MRK 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 12:20" />Ŋ'esa oŋɔ̃, eli yam ngelemɔ̃ li baan b'abɔɔl nsiaan. Muaan wu ɛ̃kwel obaal ɔ̃kal, ndɛ okwi k'abɔɔ muaan y'ɔ̃kaal ondɛ wɛ. <verse eid="MRK 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 12:21" />Muaan wa buaal obaal ɔ̃pfiil, ndɛ hɛ̃ okwi k'abɔɔ muaan y'ɔ̃kaal ondɛ wɛ. Esi kɛn obobɔ me muaan wu atyel. <verse eid="MRK 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 12:22" />Bɔ bueel ange-nsiaan abaal ɔ̃kaal ondɛ, kɛn a wu obɔ muaan ye ndɛ pyɛ. Ke mbee a bɔ bueel, ɔ̃kaal ondɛ hɛ̃ okwi. <verse eid="MRK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 12:23" />Ke ŋ'ekieel esiool b'ákwi-ákwi, ndɛ àkal ɔ̃kal nã onse baan-ngoo ange-nsiaan obɔ? Ke ngwel wɛ, bɔ bueel ábaal ndɛ!» <verse eid="MRK 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 12:24" />Yeso obveel bɔ ndiri: «Byɛ eli onse odzɛɛn, me ndɔɔ yɛn byɛ k'eyɛɛ m'ákel onse Ɔ̃nkaan a Nziã wɛ, byɛ hɛ̃ k'eyɛɛ waan e ndɛ wɛ. <verse eid="MRK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 12:25" />Ke ngwel wɛ, ŋ'ekieel esiool baal onse b'ákwi-ákwi, akaal y'abɔɔl k'àbaal bakyɛ wɛ. Kɛn a bɔ akieel akal onge ãnzwel ke ywel. <verse eid="MRK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 12:26" />Me b'otal osiool o b'ákwi-ákwi, byɛ kɛn etsiɔ b'élieel Nziã onse ɔ̃kaan a Moyize me ndɔɔ a muaan ɔ̃ti wu ákekaan mbaa wɛ? Ndɛ mpii álieel ndiri: “Mɛ̃, mɛ̃ ndi Nziã a Abalayam, Nziã a Isak, Nziã a Dzakab<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:6">Opa 3.6</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 3:15">15</ref></char></note>”!» <verse eid="MRK 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 12:27" />Yeso olweel bubu: «Nziã k'ali Nziã a b'ákwi-ákwi wɛ, ndɛ oli Nziã a baal b'amwiĩ-mwiĩ. Byɛ eli onse odzɛɛn b'onduru ɔ̃ndel.»<verse eid="MRK 12:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ngel yi enduru mãkyɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 12:28" />Ɔ̃yiool-ãngel ngɔmɔ̃ wu ayoo k'ebetsuun bɔ, bvool amwɛn kwɛn Yeso abveel Asadusɛɛn ngesɛ, oyefuul ndɛ bubu: «Onse ãngel mam mbueel, ngel yi enduru mãkyɛ yɛn?» <verse eid="MRK 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 12:29" />Yeso obveel ndiri: «Ngel yi enduru mãkyɛ yɔ yi: “Isalayel, yoo! Mfam Nziã a bia-byɛ oli kɛn a ndyam-sii wu oli Mfam. <verse eid="MRK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 12:30" />Yɛ adzii Mfam Nziã a yɛ m'ɔ̃kwal a yɛ ndyam wueel, m'omwiĩ o yɛ bam bueel, m'ãtsam ã yɛ mam mbueel, me mpɛn a yɛ yam yueel<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:5">Det 6.5</ref></char></note>.” <verse eid="MRK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 12:31" />Tal yi mbuaal yi efɛɛn onge oyɔ: “Yɛ àdzii ngaburu-mbuul onge b'edzii yɛ nzuru a yam. K'eli ye ngel nkyam yi enduru m'ãnge-mbuaal omɔ̃ wɛ<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:18">Lev 19.18</ref></char></note>.”» <verse eid="MRK 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 12:32" />Ɔ̃yiool-ãngel ondɛ bu alieel Yeso ndiri: «Taa-taa Ɔ̃tee! B'eyɛɛn yɛ wɛn Mfam Nziã oli kɛn a ndyam-sii oli otaa-taa, bvool Nziã ɔ̃kyam wɛn onge ndɛ pyɛ. <verse eid="MRK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 12:33" />Odzii o ndɛ m'ɔ̃kwal a yɛ ndyam wueel, m'omwiĩ o yɛ bam bueel, m'ãtsam ã yɛ mam mbueel, me mpɛn a yɛ yam yueel, y'odzii o ngaburu-mbuul onge b'edzii yɛ nzuru a yam, oyɔ ndɔɔ yi enduru owa o Nziã kab li edzio lam lueel y'ãkab mãkyɛ.» <verse eid="MRK 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 12:34" />Yeso ayemwɛn kwɛn ɔ̃yiool-ãngel obveel y'ãyal mbueel, ndɛ olieel ndɛ bubu: «Yɛ k'eli lala y'Okwɛn o Nziã wɛ.» Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, mbuul bvool wu ákembio k'afuul ndɛ ɛ̃mfuul pyɛ.<verse eid="MRK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="ms1">Mãsia ye David</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 12:35" />Yeso ákeyiool onse Nzɔ a Nziã, ndɛ bu afuul ɔ̃mfuul wu: «M'emã ayiool b'ãngel abeliaal ndiri Mãsia oli muaan a David? <verse eid="MRK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 12:36" />David ndyam, ŋ'éluul ndɛ m'Ɔ̃fel wu Ɔ̃nsensal, oyɛɛn ndiri: “Mfam olieel ye Mfam a mɛ̃ ndiri: Y'abva nsɛn me nkuɔ e mɛ̃ ki elam, tiil ye k'esuul mɛ̃ ataal a yɛ ke nsɛn a ntaã e yɛ.”<verse eid="MRK 12:36" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 12:37" />David ndyam oti ndɛ me “Mfam”, k'emfa emã kyɛn Mãsia akal bvool muaan a David?» Obobɔ, embuul e baal bibi ékeyoo ndɛ y'esɛ.<verse eid="MRK 12:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Obee k'akal onge ayiool b'ãngel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 12:38" />Onse ãndɔɔ m'ékeyiool Yeso, ndɛ ákeliaal baal bueel bubu: «Ekal y'onkyab me ndɔɔ ayiool b'ãngel, bɔ adzii k'adzuu m'ekɔ bvi ela-bvi ela bvool adzii kwɛn baal abio bɔ k'ãtaan. <verse eid="MRK 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 12:39" />Bɔ abesuaal ãkiri m'ɛ̃kwel onse ãnzɔ ã bɔ m'ãbuɛɛn bvool abesuaal ãmboo mã nkwel k'ãpfuun. <verse eid="MRK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 12:40" />Bɔ abekuaal eluɔ bvieel bvi eli y'akaal b'apfiil, bvool me lio lili bɔ abesa ãbuɛɛn m'ãla-m'ãla me ndɔɔ yi asa empa onge bɛn bɔ ali dzu. M'ãndɔɔ omɔ̃, Nziã akieel awa bɔ etumbu ki enduru ki b'asiil mpuru!»<verse eid="MRK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kab li ɔ̃kaal wu ɔ̃pfiil</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 12:41" />Yeso ábvi nsɛn onse Nzɔ a Nziã, nsɔ̃-a-nsɔ̃ eluɔ ki abelɔ ãkab bvool áketal emfa ki ekelɔ baal nzi. Apfel booboo ákelɔ nzi bibi. <verse eid="MRK 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 12:42" />Kɛn ɔ̃kaal ngɔmɔ̃ wu ɔ̃pfiil wu ali ɔ̃ywa oyi bu olɔ edzi-dzi bviaal bvi ãbvieel. <verse eid="MRK 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 12:43" />Obobɔ, Yeso oti ayio a ndɛ mbel bvool olieel bɔ bubu: «Taa-taa bam, mɛ̃ ngyɛɛn byɛ wɛn, ɔ̃pfiil wu ɔ̃ywal wu olɔ nzi yi nduru yi baal bueel onse eluɔ ki abelɔ ãkab. <verse eid="MRK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 12:44" />Ke ngwel wɛ baal bueel alɔ nzi yɛn bɔ k'ali ye kɔɔ e yɔ wɛ. Kɛn a ndɛ, onse oywal o ndɛ, olɔ nzi yam yueel yi eli a ndɛ, nzi yi ekedza ndɛ me yɔ.»<verse eid="MRK 12:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MRK 13" />
  <para style="s1">Otsɔɔn o Nzɔ a Nziã</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 13:1" />Onge bɛn Yeso aleyii apal onse Nzɔ a Nziã, ngɔmɔ̃ onse ayio a ndɛ olieel ndɛ bubu: «Ɔ̃tee, tal ãnkɔɔn mã m'obvie! Tal ntuu-ntuu a nzɔ yi m'ompal!» <verse eid="MRK 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 13:2" />Yeso obveel ndɛ bubu: «Yɛ amwɛn ãnzɔ m'ãnɛn mã? Mbueel ãkieel ãtsɔɔn: Nkɔɔn si ngamɔ̃ kieel k'esiil nkal a yinkyɛ wɛ.»<verse eid="MRK 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ãndɔɔ m'ãya ye k'etɔ ntɔ a ɔ̃kiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 13:3" />Yeso obvi nsɛn nkal a nkio a ɛ̃ti mi Olibve, nsɔ̃-a-nsɔ̃ a Nzɔ a Nziã. Piɛɛl, ye Dzak, ye Dzaã, y'Ãndele b'áli kɛn a bam ye ndɛ, afuul ndɛ bubu: <verse eid="MRK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 13:4" />«Meyɛɛn bee, lio emã li ekieel eya ãndɔɔ omɔ̃? Eliĩ emã ki ekieel esuo ntɔ a ãndɔɔ omɔ̃ mam mbueel?» <verse eid="MRK 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 13:5" />Obobɔ, Yeso obvi bɔ oliaal bubu: «Ekal y'onkyab kwɛn mbuul abee byɛ opfuru! <verse eid="MRK 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 13:6" />Baal bibi akieel aya me nkuũ a mɛ̃ bvool ayɛɛn ndiri: “Mãsia mɛ̃!” Bvool bɔ akieel apfuru ɔ̃bɔbɔ a baal. <verse eid="MRK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 13:7" />Ŋ'ekieel eyoo byɛ ɔ̃sam wu ãmvel ye wu ɔ̃nyiil wu ãmvel, oŋɔ̃ ɛ̃kwal ɛ̃ byɛ ebee ke ywel okal. Ke ngwel wɛ, ebvaan kwɛn ãndɔɔ omɔ̃ ãbwel. Kɛn oyɔ kieel k'ekal ntɔ a ɔ̃kiri kɛn wɛ. <verse eid="MRK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 13:8" />Ke ngwel wɛ, ɔ̃kiri ngɔmɔ̃ akieel adzwaan ye wukyɛ, okwɛn ngɔmɔ̃ hɛ̃ okieel odzwaan ye bokyɛ. M'ãmboo bibi, nsie ekieel enziool nzuru, bvool ekieel ekal y'ɛ̃lɔɔ. Ãndɔɔ omɔ̃ mbueel ãkieel ãkal onge obɛɛn b'obaan o mwiĩ b'eyoo ɔ̃kaal wu oyii ayi oburu. <verse eid="MRK 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 13:9" />Me b'otal byɛ, ekal y'onkyab me ndɔɔ a byam. Ke ngwel wɛ, baal akieel abiri byɛ k'ãmbal m'Ayuda, akieel abɛɛl byɛ onse ãnzɔ m'ãbuɛɛn m'Ayuda. Byɛ ekieel eyetsuun ke nkwel ambiri y'akwɛn me ndɔɔ a mɛ̃. M'emfa okyɛ, byɛ ekieel etsweel mɛ̃ ke nkwel a bɔ. <verse eid="MRK 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 13:10" />Ebvaan ŋ'ɛ̃kwel kɛn atsal Nsia yi Ngesɛ onse ɛ̃kiri mvieel. <verse eid="MRK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 13:11" />Ŋ'akieel abiri byɛ k'ãmbal, ŋ'ɛ̃kwel ebee nguo okɛɛ me b'eyeyɛɛn byɛ, kɛn a byɛ eyɛɛn ãyɛɛn m'àwa byɛ me lio olɔ, ke ngwel wɛ, byɛ ke b'ekieel eyɛɛn wɛ, Ɔ̃fel wu Ɔ̃nsensal wu akieel ayɛɛn. <verse eid="MRK 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 13:12" />Muaan-ngoo akieel atiɔ muaan-ngoo kwɛn abam ndɛ. Tal akieel atiɔ muaan. Baan akieel akal ataal b'aburu a bɔ, bvool akieel asa kwɛn abam bɔ. <verse eid="MRK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 13:13" />Baal bueel akieel abyal byɛ me ndɔɔ a nkuũ a mɛ̃. Kɛn a wu akieel akuru ɔ̃kwal tiil ntɔ, wu akieel abvuul.<verse eid="MRK 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Fool li bibi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 13:14" />Ŋ'ekieel emwɛn byɛ ki ata m'“Eluɔ ki ongɛɛ” etɛɛn onse mboo yɛn kyɛ k'ekeekal oŋɔ̃ wɛ, yɔɔl kwɛn mbuul wu atsiɔ akwaal otsɛn ngesɛ! Obobɔ, yɔɔl kwɛn b'akieel akiɔɔl ke nsie a Yude abal onse ãnkio. <verse eid="MRK 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 13:15" />Yɔɔl kwɛn mbuul wu akieel akiɔɔl ke ywel a sɛɛ e nzɔ li pɛɛl abee obesool, me ndɔɔ yi ye awal eluɔ onse nzɔ. <verse eid="MRK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 13:16" />Yɔɔl kwɛn mbuul wu akieel akiɔɔl k'ãnguun abee nzɔ obekɔɔl, me ndɔɔ yi ayewal kadzaka. <verse eid="MRK 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 13:17" />Ãwua m'ãtsoo omɔ̃ m'akaal b'akieel akal y'ãyam, ye b'akieel awa baan ãbiaal! <verse eid="MRK 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 13:18" />Ebuɛɛn, kwɛn ãndɔɔ omɔ̃ ãbee obwel me lio e mfyɛ! <verse eid="MRK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 13:19" />Ke ngwel wɛ, m'ãtsoo omɔ̃, ekieel ekal ye fool lam bibi, m'emfa kyɛn fool li obobɔ lɔɔ-okal kɛn amwɛn lɔ wɛ, fa k'ébɛɛn ɔ̃kiri, ŋ'ébuo Nziã eluɔ bvieel, tiil meba, bvool fool li obobɔ kieel k'ebekal bam wɛ. <verse eid="MRK 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 13:20" />Okɛɛn Mfam k'ákueel ɔ̃bvɛn wu ãtsoo omɔ̃ wɛ, k'ekeekal ye mbuul wu abvuul wɛ. Kɛn a ndɛ ákueel ɔ̃bvɛn a mɔ̃, me ndɔɔ a baal b'ésueel ndɛ. <verse eid="MRK 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 13:21" />Obobɔ, okɛɛn mbuul olieel byɛ ndiri: “Etal, Mãsia oli ŋã!”, wuo ndiri: “Etal, ndɛ oli ku!” Ebee ndɛ okiool. <verse eid="MRK 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 13:22" />Ke ngwel wɛ, amãsia ba mfya y'aliaa-ɛ̃kiɛɛn ba mfya akieel apal. Bɔ akieel asa emvieel y'emwa me ndɔɔ yi afuru baal bueel. Okɛɛn bɔ akoo, bɔ apfuru onkyam b'ésueel Nziã. <verse eid="MRK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 13:23" />Oŋɔ̃ byɛ ekal angɔ-mwiĩ. Mɛ̃ bu ngwi byɛ ãnkunkwa obɔ.<verse eid="MRK 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Oya o Muaan a mbuul</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 13:24" />Kɛn a m'ãtsoo omɔ̃, ke mbee a lio li fool olɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 13:24">tal ekieel epiin,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 13:24">nswii kieel k'abepaal mvieel wɛ,<verse eid="MRK 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 13:25" />angam-a-ngam akieel abva ke ywel,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 13:25">ɛ̃fel ɛ̃ waan mi ke ywel ɛ̃kieel ɛ̃tiɔɔl.<verse eid="MRK 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 13:26" />Obobɔ, baal akieel amwɛn k'eya Muaan a Mbuul onse epɛn ye waan bibi bvool ye lweel. <verse eid="MRK 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 13:27" />Ndɛ akieel ayuɔɔl ãnzwel. M'etswi enge-enã bvi ɔ̃kiri a nsie, mɔ̃ ãkieel ãbvool baal b'ésueel ndɛ.<verse eid="MRK 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mboo a ɔ̃ti a fig</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 13:28" />Eyɔɔl kwɛn mboo a ɔ̃ti wa fig ewa byɛ ãyal: Ŋ'emwɛn byɛ kwɛn ãmpɔɔ̃ ã ndɛ ãyii dzoo-dzoo, bvool ãbvi ãnyuɔɔn opaal, oŋɔ̃ byɛ eyɛɛ wɛn ɔ̃mvu wu alili oyii tsotsoo. <verse eid="MRK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 13:29" />Emfa kiki, ŋ'ekieel emwɛn byɛ ãndɔɔ omɔ̃ ãyii ãbebwel, eyɛɛ wɛn Muaan a Mbuul oyii tsotsoo k'edzoo. <verse eid="MRK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 13:30" />Taa-taa bam, mɛ̃ eyɛɛn byɛ wɛn, baal ba lio li kieel k'akwa wɛ, y'ekeya ãndɔɔ omɔ̃ mbueel. <verse eid="MRK 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 13:31" />Ywel ye nsie ekieel ebwel, kɛn ãyɛɛn ã mɛ̃ kieel k'ãbwel mam wɛ.<verse eid="MRK 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Wu oyɛɛ lio e ntɔ a ɔ̃kiri nã?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 13:32" />Kɛn a me b'otal tsoo ye lio, mbuul wu oyɛɛ mɔ̃ pyɛ, onkyam ãnzwel ke ywel, onkyam Muaan. Wu oyɛɛ mɔ̃ kɛn a Taal ndyam. <verse eid="MRK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 13:33" />Ekal angɔ-mwiĩ! Ke ngwe l wɛ, byɛ k'eyɛɛ lio li ekieel etɔ ɔ̃nywã-tsoo wɛ. <verse eid="MRK 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 13:34" />Ekieel ekal onge bɛn mbuul ngɔmɔ̃ oyɛn odzuu: Ndɛ ombal nzɔ a ndɛ, bu asiil yɔ me mviɔɔl mi asal a ndɛ. Ndɛ owi mbuul bwɛn a mbuul ɔ̃sal wu esa ndɛ, bu atam ɔ̃nkiaal a edzoo ndiri akal ngɔ-mwiĩ. <verse eid="MRK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 13:35" />Obobɔ, ekal angɔ-mwiĩ, ke ngwel wɛ byɛ k'eyɛɛ lio li èya nga-nzɔ wɛ: Owɛɛl èkal m'ãnkukwa, wuo nkal a kuku, wuo ŋ'ekuaal nswee, wuo m'epal. <verse eid="MRK 13:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 13:36" />K'ebvaan kwɛn ndɛ ayebvool enseel, oyebɔɔ byɛ me twal wɛ. <verse eid="MRK 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 13:37" />M'eyɛɛn mɛ̃ byɛ mã, mɛ̃ eyɛɛn mɔ̃ me baal bueel: Ekal angɔ-mwiĩ!»<verse eid="MRK 13:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MRK 14" />
  <para style="s1">Amfam b'Ayuda ayɛn Yeso mfoo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 14:1" />Al'emeesiil ãtsoo mbuaal m'abɛɛl pfuun li Onduru bvool li amãmpa bɛn k'ali ye libviil wɛ. Amfam b'angaa-a-Nziã y'ayiool b'ãngel ákebii mpwee yi asiin Yeso m'ãyal, me ndɔɔ yi abam ndɛ. <verse eid="MRK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 14:2" />Ke ngwel wɛ, bɔ ákeyɛɛn bam-a-bam ndiri: «Bia-byɛ ebee ndɛ osiin onse pfuun, kwɛn oŋɔ̃ tsungaa abee onse baal obva.»<verse eid="MRK 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔ̃kaal ngɔmɔ̃ oyiri Yeso ãnãsi m'ɔ̃tswɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 14:3" />Yeso áli k'ola bo Betani, onse nzɔ a Simɔ̃ wɛn tsɔɔn áli y'ãlu me leba. Me lio li ékedza ndɛ, ɔ̃kaal ngɔmɔ̃ osam y'ɔ̃langa wu alebat wu áluul m'ãnãsi mã nzi bibi mã naad m'ãywɛn a ɔ̃mfee. Ndɛ odzweel ɔ̃langa, bu ayiri ãnãsi nkal ɔ̃tswɛ a Yeso. <verse eid="MRK 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 14:4" />Baal bakyɛ onse b'áli oŋɔ̃ ayoo nkie bvool ayɛɛn bam-a-bam ndiri: «Ndɔɔ mã yi abɔɔ̃ ãnãsi m'emfa ki? <verse eid="MRK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 14:5" />Al'ekoo k'etiɔ mɔ̃ me nzi yi ãbvieel onse ab'ɛ̃kam-ɛ̃tyel (300), kwɛn ewa yɔ aywal!» Bɔ bu ayi mpuru y'ɔ̃kaal ondɛ. <verse eid="MRK 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 14:6" />Kɛn a Yeso olieel bubu: «Eyɔɔl ndɛ akal pi! Nkyal yi esa byɛ ndɛ yi emã? Yi esi ndɛ me ndɔɔ a mɛ̃ eli ndɔɔ yi mvɛ. <verse eid="MRK 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 14:7" />Ke ngwel wɛ, aywal, byɛ ekal ye bɔ lio lueel, bvool byɛ ekoo k'esa bɔ obvɛ lio lam lueel li edzii byɛ. Kɛn a mɛ̃, byɛ k'èkal ye mɛ̃ lio lueel wɛ. <verse eid="MRK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 14:8" />Ndɛ osi ndɔɔ yi ekoo ndɛ osa. Ndɛ ofaal nzuru a mɛ̃ nkwel, ŋ'eyiri ndɛ yɔ ãnasi me ndɔɔ odziool o yɔ. <verse eid="MRK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 14:9" />Taa-taa bam, mɛ̃ eyɛɛn byɛ wɛn, mboo yam yueel yi akieel atsal Nsia yi Ngesɛ m'ɔ̃kiri ndyam wueel, akieel ayɛɛn hɛ̃ me ndɔɔ yi esi ɔ̃kaal wu, me ndɔɔ yi atsam ndɛ.»<verse eid="MRK 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yuda okuru k'atiɔ Yeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 14:10" />Yuda Isikaliot wu áli ngɔmɔ̃ onse antam kuun ye buaal oyebɔɔ amfam b'angaa-a-Nziã, me ndɔɔ yi atiɔ bɔ Yeso. <verse eid="MRK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 14:11" />Ŋ'eyoo bɔ obobɔ, bɔ asia mpaa, bu alieel ndiri bɔ àwa ndɛ nzi. Obobɔ, Yuda bu ayii abii mpwee yi ngesɛ yi etiɔ ndɛ bɔ Yeso.<verse eid="MRK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso odzi bvi odza e Pak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 14:12" />Tsoo li ɛ̃kwel li Pfuun li amampa bɛn k'ali ye lebviil wɛ, tsoo li abam emɛmɛɛ̃ me ndɔɔ a bvi-odza bvi pfuun li Onduru, ayio a Yeso afuul ndɛ bubu: «Yɛ dzii kwɛn bee eyeyɛɛl yɛ ɔ̃laan wa pfuun li Onduru kwɛn?» <verse eid="MRK 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 14:13" />Yeso bu ayuɔɔl buaal onse ayio a ndɛ ndiri: «Eyi onse bviil li ke nkwel li, mbuul ngɔmɔ̃ wu obiri mbuu a ãdza ayemwɛɛn ye byɛ. Enɔɔn a ndɛ. <verse eid="MRK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 14:14" />Me lio li èsam ndɛ onse nzɔ ngamɔ̃, eyɛɛn nga-yɔ wɛn: “Ɔ̃tee otam bee yɛ ofuul ndiri: Etswi e nzɔ ki èyedza mɛ̃ pfuun li Onduru y'ayio a mɛ̃ kyɛn?” <verse eid="MRK 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 14:15" />Obobɔ, ndɛ àsuo byɛ etswi e nzɔ ki ywel ki enɛn ki amaayɛɛl. Oyɔ mboo yi èwal byɛ ɔ̃yɛɛl wa pfuun.» <verse eid="MRK 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 14:16" />Ayio ayɛn, bɔ atɔ bviil, amwɛn ãndɔɔ kɛn a m'emfa ki elieel Yeso bɔ. Bɔ bu awel ɔ̃yɛɛl wa pfuun li Onduru.<verse eid="MRK 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 14:17" />Ŋ'etɔ ãnkukwal, Yeso oyi y'ayio ange-kuun ye buaal. <verse eid="MRK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 14:18" />Me lio li éli bɔ ke misa bvool ákedza, Yeso olieel bubu: «Taa-taa bam, mɛ̃ eyɛɛn byɛ wɛn, ngɔmɔ̃ onse byɛ, wu abedza ye mɛ̃, àtiɔ mɛ̃.» <verse eid="MRK 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 14:19" />Ayio ãwua ãbɔɔ, bu abvi ofuul me mbuul bwɛn a mbuul ndiri: «Ondɛ ol'ekal mɛ̃?» <verse eid="MRK 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 14:20" />Yeso obveel bɔ ndiri: «Eli ngɔmɔ̃ onse byɛ b'ayio kuun ye buaal, wu alɔ kuɔɔl onse saan ye mɛ̃. <verse eid="MRK 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 14:21" />Ke yam, Muaan a Mbuul àkwa onge b'eyɛɛn Ɔ̃nkaan a Nziã, kɛn ãwua mã bibi me ndɛ ondɛ wu atiɔ Muaan a Mbuul! Ngesɛ ákaabee mbuul ondɛ oburu!»<verse eid="MRK 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔ̃laan a Mfam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 14:22" />Ŋ'eyii edza bɔ, Yeso owel mampa, obveel Nziã ãtuɛɛn, otsiil ndɛ, owi ayio ndɛ ye y'ãyɛɛn m'ɔ̃nywa ndiri: «Ewal, yi-bu nzuru a mɛ̃.» <verse eid="MRK 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 14:23" />Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, ndɛ owel bvool mbiɔ a mbal ã bvine, obveel Nziã ãtuɛɛn, owi ayio yɔ, bɔ bueel bu anywi mɔ̃. <verse eid="MRK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 14:24" />Ndɛ olieel bɔ bubu: «Mã-bu ãkel ã mɛ̃, ãkel m'ondoo, m'ãtsɔɔn me ndɔɔ ɔ̃bobɔ a baal. <verse eid="MRK 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 14:25" />Taa-taa bam, mɛ̃ eyɛɛn byɛ wɛn, mɛ̃ bvool kieel k'ebenywa mbal ã bvine wɛ tiil tsoo li ekieel enywa mɛ̃ mɔ̃ m'ãlili onse Okwɛn o Nziã.» <verse eid="MRK 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 14:26" />Ke mbee a ŋ'eyam bɔ ãnziĩ, bɔ apal, bu ayɛn sua nkio a ɛ̃ti mi Olibve.<verse eid="MRK 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso olieel ndiri Piɛɛl akieel atwɛn ndiri ndɛ k'ayɛɛ ndɛ wɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 14:27" />Yeso olieel ayio bubu: «M'ã̀ya me mɛ̃, ã̀nziool byɛ bueel onse okiool. Ke ngwel wɛ, ákel bubu: “Mɛ̃ èbɛɛl ɔ̃mbuaal-anyam, ɔ̃kel wu emɛmɛɛ̃ àtsɔɔn”. <verse eid="MRK 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 14:28" />Kɛn a ke mbee osiool o mɛ̃, mɛ̃ ètsɔɔn nkwel a byɛ ke Ngalile.» <verse eid="MRK 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 14:29" />Piɛɛl abvuru oyɛɛn, olieel ndɛ bubu: «Onkyam ŋɛn m'ã̀ya me yɛ anziool bakyɛ bueel, mɔ̃ k'ãnziool mɛ̃ ndyam wɛ!» <verse eid="MRK 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 14:30" />Yeso bu abveel ndɛ ndiri: «Taa-taa bam, mɛ̃ eyɛɛn yɛ wɛ, kɛn a me tsia wu, ye k'ekuaal nswee nsa yuaal, yɛ ndyam àtwɛn nsa tyel wɛn yɛ ke yɛɛ mɛ̃ wɛ.» <verse eid="MRK 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 14:31" />Kɛn a Piɛɛl opio ɔ̃liɛɛn ndiri: «Onkyam ŋɛn ebvaan mɛ̃ ekwa ye yɛ, mɛ̃ k'ekoo k'etwɛn wɛ wɛn mɛ̃ ke ngyɛɛ yɛ wɛ!» Obobɔ, ayio bueel ayɛɛn kɛn ɔ̃nywã ngɔmɔ̃.<verse eid="MRK 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ãbuɛɛn ã Yeso ke Ngetesemane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 14:32" />Bɔ atɔ ke mboo ngamɔ̃ yi abeta me Ngetesemane. Yeso bu alieel ayio ndiri: «Ebva nsɛn ŋã, me lio li èyebuɛɛn mɛ̃.» <verse eid="MRK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 14:33" />Ndɛ obiri Piɛɛl, ye Dzak, ye Dzaã. Ndɛ obvi buɔ y'ãwua oyoo. <verse eid="MRK 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 14:34" />Ndɛ olieel bɔ bubu: «Mɛ̃ eyoo ãwua m'ãbiri mɛ̃ k'epfu. Esiil ŋã, ekal angɔ-mwiĩ!» <verse eid="MRK 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 14:35" />Ndɛ osyel muaan-lala, otyel nzuru me nsie, bu abuɛɛn me ndɔɔ yɛn, okɛɛn ndɔɔ yɛn akoo k'asa, Nziã asa kwɛn lio li fool olɔ esyal lala ye ndɛ. <verse eid="MRK 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 14:36" />Ndɛ oyɛɛn bubu: «Aba, Taal yɛ koo k'asa mbueel. Siaal mbiɔ yi lala ye mɛ̃. Kɛn a yɔɔl kwɛn yɛ bee be nzii mɛ̃ ndyam osa, yɛ sa b'edzii yɛ ndyam.» <verse eid="MRK 14:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 14:37" />Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, ndɛ okɔɔl ola ayio ange-atyel, oyebɔɔ bɔ amaayiool me twa. Ndɛ bu alieel Piɛɛl ndiri: «Simɔ̃, yɛ laal twal! Yɛ ke man k'akal ngɔ-mwiĩ si ekal lio ngelemɔ̃ wɛ! <verse eid="MRK 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 14:38" />Ekal angɔ-mwiĩ bvool ebuɛɛn, kwɛn byɛ ebee m'ɔ̃mbio obva. Ɔ̃fel oli ye mpɛn, kɛn a nzuru eli y'okwal.»<verse eid="MRK 14:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 14:39" />Ndɛ bvool osyel muaan-lala, bu abuɛɛn m'ãyɛɛn amamã. <verse eid="MRK 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 14:40" />Ndɛ okɔɔl bvool ol'ayio, bvool oyebɔɔ bɔ amaayiool me twal, ke ngwel wɛ bɔ mviil ãl'ãyii y'olyam. Bɔ k'abɔɔ ndɔɔ yi abveel ndɛ wɛ. <verse eid="MRK 14:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 14:41" />Ŋ'ekɔɔl ndɛ li nsa tyel, ndɛ olieel bɔ bubu: «Byɛ kɛn ebelaal twal bvool ebewuun! Ŋ'ɔ̃fi. Lio ekoo. Meba ŋã, atiɔ Muaan a Mbuul me mviɔɔl mi anga-ãbi. <verse eid="MRK 14:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 14:42" />Etɛɛn, bia-byɛ eyi! Mbuul wu àtiɔ mɛ̃ oyii tsotsoo!»<verse eid="MRK 14:42" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Asiin Yeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 14:43" />Ŋ'ékeyɛɛn Yeso kɛn ãndɔɔ omɔ̃, Yuda wu áli ngɔmɔ̃ onse ayio kuun ye buaal opal oŋɔ̃. Ndɛ áli y'embuul e baal b'ábiri epwel y'ɛ̃mpaã. B'áyuɔɔl baal obɔ éli amfam b'anga-a-Nziã, y'ayiool b'ãngel, y'akuul-kuul. <verse eid="MRK 14:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 14:44" />Yuda wu àtiɔ Yeso al'amaaliaal baal obɔ eliĩ ki èsa ndɛ, ndiri: «Mbuul wu èbuun mɛ̃, ndɛ ondɛ, esiin ndɛ, ebiri ndɛ bvool ekyab ndɛ ngesɛ.» <verse eid="MRK 14:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 14:45" />Tswa-a-tswa oŋɔ̃, Yuda osyel tsotsoo a Yeso, bu alieel ndɛ bubu: «Ɔ̃tee, enswɛɛn obɔ!» Ndɛ bu abuun Yeso. <verse eid="MRK 14:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 14:46" />Obobɔ, bɔ asiin Yeso, bu akuru ndɛ. <verse eid="MRK 14:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 14:47" />Kɛn a ngɔmɔ̃ onse b'áli ye Yeso, ayɔɔ epwel, opfel ɔ̃sal a nga-a-Nziã wu ɔ̃nɛn kyɛ, bu atsɔɔ ndɛ tswi. <verse eid="MRK 14:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 14:48" />Yeso olieel bɔ bubu: «Byɛ mɛ̃ onge edzuul ewal, kwɛn byɛ eya ola mɛ̃ y'epwel y'ɛ̃mpaã me ndɔɔ yi esiin mɛ̃? <verse eid="MRK 14:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 14:49" />Ãtsoo mbueel mɛ̃ eli ye byɛ bvool ekeyiool onse Nzɔ a Nziã, byɛ k'eyesiin mɛ̃ wɛ. Kɛn ãndɔɔ mã ãbwel, me ndɔɔ yɛn asa m'ákel.» <verse eid="MRK 14:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 14:50" />Obobɔ, ayio bueel ayiri ndɛ, bu abal. <verse eid="MRK 14:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 14:51" />Nsam a bɔɔl ngamɔ̃ ékenɔɔn a Yeso. Ndɛ álaal kɛn emputa me nzuru. Asiin ndɛ, <verse eid="MRK 14:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 14:52" />kɛn a ndɛ oyiri emputa, bu abal odzuũ-odzuũ.<verse eid="MRK 14:52" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso ke nkwel a mbal yi nɛn yi Ayuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 14:53" />Baal b'ásiin Yeso abiri ndɛ ola nga-a-Nziã wu ɔ̃nɛn. Amfam b'anga-a-Nziã bueel, y'aku-kuul, y'ayiool b'ãngel abvɔɔn okɔ. <verse eid="MRK 14:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 14:54" />Piɛɛl ákeluɛɛn a Yeso lala tiil ekɔ e nzɔ a nga-a-Nziã wu ɔ̃nɛn. Ndɛ osam onse mwiĩ a kyɛ bu abvi nsɛn y'ankiaal a kyɛ bvool ákeywal mbaa. <verse eid="MRK 14:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 14:55" />Amfam b'anga-a-Nziã ye mbal yi nɛn yi Ayuda yueel ákebii elyal ki afɛn Yeso kwɛn awa ndɛ etumbu ki epfu, kɛn a bɔ k'abɔɔ kyɛ wɛ. <verse eid="MRK 14:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 14:56" />Ke ngwel wɛ, baal bibi akeya ndɛ ãndɔɔ oburu, kɛn a bɔ k'áli ɔ̃nywa ngɔmɔ̃ wɛ onse ãyɛɛn ã bɔ. <verse eid="MRK 14:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="MRK 14:57" />Baal ke kwɛ atɛɛn, bu ani ndɛ pfya bubu: <verse eid="MRK 14:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MRK 14:58" />«Bee eyoo ndɛ ayɛɛn ndiri: “Mɛ̃ etsal Nzɔ a Nziã yi àtuu me mviɔɔl ɛ̃ baal yi, bvool m'ãtsoo ã tyel, mɛ̃ ètuu kyam yɛn k'ekal yi etuu mviɔɔl ɛ̃ baal wɛ.”» <verse eid="MRK 14:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MRK 14:59" />Onkyam bɔ obɔ hɛ̃ k'áli ɔ̃nywã ngɔmɔ̃ me ndɔɔ oyɔ wɛ. <verse eid="MRK 14:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MRK 14:60" />Obobɔ, nga-a-Nziã wu ɔ̃nɛn otɛɛn kal-a-kal a baal bu afuul Yeso ndiri: «Yɛ yi abveel pyɛ? B'eyɛɛ yɛ omã m'ãbuu m'eliaal baal ba me ndɔɔ a yɛ?» <verse eid="MRK 14:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MRK 14:61" />Kɛn a Yeso owuun pi. Nga-a-Nziã wu ɔ̃nɛn bvool ofuul ndɛ ndiri: «Yɛ Mãsia wu Muaan a Nziã wu ebelweel bee li?» <verse eid="MRK 14:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="MRK 14:62" />Yeso obveel ndɛ bubu: «Hɛ̃, mɛ̃ ndɛ ndi, bvool byɛ kieel emwɛn Muaan a Mbuul me nsɛn me kuɔɔl ki elam Nziã Nga-Waan, byɛ hɛ̃ emwɛn k'eya ndɛ kal-a-kal epɛn ke ywel.» <verse eid="MRK 14:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MRK 14:63" />Obobɔ, nga-a-Nziã wu ɔ̃nɛn okɔɔl ekɔ bvool olieel ndiri: «Bia-byɛ bvool k'eli ye kɔɔ li atsweel b'ayeyɛɛn bia-byɛ ãndɔɔ mã wɛ, <verse eid="MRK 14:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MRK 14:64" />nzal-a-ŋɛn byam eyoo k'esiaan ndɛ Nziã. Byɛ ekuru omã? Bɔ bueel abweel Yeso ɔ̃dzoo, bu akuru kwɛn ndɛ ebvaan akwa.» <verse eid="MRK 14:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="MRK 14:65" />Baal ke kwɛ onse bɔ abvi ndɛ ãntɛɛ ofaan, bɔ afoo ndɛ osu, apfel ndɛ ɛ̃nkwaã, bu alieel ndɛ ndiri: «Oŋɔ̃ ta bvua, wu obɛɛl yɛ nã!» Ankiaal awel ndɛ, bu anaã ndɛ ãmpaa.<verse eid="MRK 14:65" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Piɛɛl otwɛn ndiri ndɛ k'ayɛɛ Yeso wɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="MRK 14:66" />Ŋ'esa oŋɔ̃, Piɛɛl kɛn áli ke nsie onse ekɔɔ. Ɔ̃sal ngɔmɔ̃ wu ɔ̃kaal, wu a nga-a-Nziã wu ɔ̃nɛn oyi oŋɔ̃. <verse eid="MRK 14:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="MRK 14:67" />Ŋ'emwɛn ndɛ Piɛɛl wu akeywa mbaa, ndɛ otal ndɛ ngesɛ, bu olieel ndɛ ndiri: «Yɛ hɛ̃, yɛ áli ye Yeso wu ɔ̃fi-Nadzalet.» <verse eid="MRK 14:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="MRK 14:68" />Kɛn a Piɛɛl otwɛn ndiri: «Mɛ̃ ke ngyɛɛ wɛ, mɛ̃ k'ebɔɔ b'eyɛɛn yɛ otsɛn wɛ.» Ndɛ wu Piɛɛl opal k'ɔ̃nywa wu ekɔɔ, nswee bu akueel. <verse eid="MRK 14:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="MRK 14:69" />Ŋ'emwɛn ɔ̃sal wu ɔ̃kaal ndɛ oŋɔ̃, ndɛ bvool olieel b'ali oŋɔ̃ ndiri: «Mbuul wu oli ngɔmɔ̃ onse baal a Yeso!» <verse eid="MRK 14:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="MRK 14:70" />Piɛɛl bvool otwɛn ãyɛɛn omɔ̃. Oyiil wɛ, b'áli oŋɔ̃ bvool alieel ndɛ ndiri: «Ngwanyã, yɛ hɛ̃ li ngɔmɔ̃ onse baal obɔ, ke ngwel wɛ, yɛ hɛ̃ li ɔ̃fi-Ngalile!» <verse eid="MRK 14:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="MRK 14:71" />Oŋɔ̃, Piɛɛl bu abvi obiool ndiri: «Yɔɔl Nziã awa mɛ̃ etumbu okɛɛn mɛ̃ epfuru! Mɛ̃ ndab ɔ̃kyel wɛn mɛ̃ ke ngyɛɛ mbuul wu ebeyɛɛn byɛ ondɛ wɛ.» <verse eid="MRK 14:71" /><verse number="72" style="v" sid="MRK 14:72" />Kɛn alili oŋɔ̃, nswee okueel li nsa yuaal. Piɛɛl bu ayeel ãyɛɛn m'élieel Yeso ndɛ ndiri: «Ye k'ekuaal tswee nsa yuaal, yɛ atwɛn nsa tyel wɛn yɛ ke yɛɛ mɛ̃ wɛ.» Ndɛ bu abvi elel obool.<verse eid="MRK 14:72" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MRK 15" />
  <para style="s1">Yeso ke nkwel a Pilate</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 15:1" />M'epal-epal kwɔɔl, amfam b'anga- a-Nziã abvɔɔn y'aku-kuul y'ayiool b'angel ye mbaa yi nɛn yi Ayuda yueel. Bɔ akuru Yeso ebwal, abiri ndɛ, bu ayewa ndɛ ola Pilate. <verse eid="MRK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 15:2" />Pilate ofuul ndɛ ndiri: «Yɛ ndyam ɔ̃kwɛn Ayuda li?» Yeso obveel ndɛ ndiri: «Yɛ mbuul wu oyɛɛn yɔ.» <verse eid="MRK 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 15:3" />Amfam b'anga-a-Nziã aburu ndɛ ãndɔɔ bibi. <verse eid="MRK 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 15:4" />Pilate bvool ofuul ndɛ bubu: «Yɛ ndɔɔ yi abveel pyɛ? Yoo ãndɔɔ mbueel m'efɛn bɔ yɛ!» <verse eid="MRK 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 15:5" />Kɛn a Yeso k'abebveel ndɔɔ si ngamɔ̃ wɛ, bu esi Pilate ɛ̃kam.<verse eid="MRK 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Awi Yeso etumbu ki lepfu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 15:6" />Me pfuun bwɛn a pfuun li Onduru, Pilate akepaal mbuul a bwal ngɔmɔ̃ wu ékesɔɔ baal. <verse eid="MRK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 15:7" />Ŋ'esa oŋɔ̃, eli ye mbuul wɛn nkuũ Balabas wu áli onse bwal y'andoo a ndɛ me ndɔɔ yɛn bɔ ábam mbuul me lio li ebvi tsuunga. <verse eid="MRK 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 15:8" />Embuul eyi nzɔ a Pilate, bu ebvi osɔɔ ola ndɛ ndiri asa bɔ ndɔɔ yi ebesa ndɛ bɔ tsɔɔn. <verse eid="MRK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 15:9" />Pilate obveel bɔ bubu: «Byɛ edzii kwɛn mɛ̃ mpaal byɛ ɔ̃kwɛn Ayuda?» <verse eid="MRK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 15:10" />Ke ngwel wɛ, ndɛ áyɛɛ ngesɛ kwɛn amfam b'anga-a-Nziã áwi Yeso me mviɔɔl ɛ̃ ndɛ m'ɔ̃kwal nsɔɔ. <verse eid="MRK 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 15:11" />Kɛn a amfam b'anga-a-Nziã atsɛɛn baal k'asɔɔ kwɛn Pilate apaal bɔ Balabas. <verse eid="MRK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 15:12" />Pilate bvool owel oyɛɛn bu afuul bɔ bubu: «Ki edzii byɛ kyam emã ki esa mɛ̃ ndɛ wu ebeta byɛ m'ɔ̃kwɛn Ayuda?» <verse eid="MRK 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 15:13" />Bɔ bvool abvi obiool ndiri: «Bɛɛl ndɛ m'ekulusu!» <verse eid="MRK 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 15:14" />Pilate ofuul bɔ bubu: «K'obi omã b'esi ndɛ?» Kɛn a bɔ awɛɛl mpɛn m'obiool ndiri: «Bɛɛl ndɛ m'ekulusu!» <verse eid="MRK 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 15:15" />Pilate okuru k'asa embuul e baal esɛ, bu apaal bɔ Balabas. Ke mbee a ŋ'etam ndɛ Yeso ɔ̃dzii opfel m'asikɔrɔ, ndɛ owi bɔ ndɛ kwɛn abɛɛl ndɛ m'ekulusu.<verse eid="MRK 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ambwel-mbwel asɔɔl Yeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 15:16" />Ambwel-mbwel abiri ndɛ onse ekɔɔ e mfam, bu ati nkel ambwel-mbwel yueel mbel. <verse eid="MRK 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 15:17" />Bɔ alaal ndɛ ekɔ ki abendɔɔl ke ywel, ki bɛ, bvool andɔɔl ndɛ ekɔrɔ ki okwɛn ki m'ɛ̃mbɛɛl mi ãnsiɛɛn nkal ɔ̃tswɛ. <verse eid="MRK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 15:18" />Bɔ bu abvi ndɛ obio ndiri: «Ɔ̃kwɛn Ayuda, letswɛɛn obɔ!» <verse eid="MRK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 15:19" />Bɔ ákebɛɛl ndɛ ɔ̃mpaã m'ɔ̃tswɛ, ákefaan ndɛ ãtɛɛ bvool ákebva ãbuo ke nkwel a ndɛ me ndɔɔ yi alweel ndɛ. <verse eid="MRK 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 15:20" />Ŋ'esɔɔl-esɔɔl bɔ ndɛ, bɔ ambaal ndɛ ekɔ ki abendɔɔl ke ywel ki bɛ bu abveel ndɛ ekɔ e ndɛ. Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, bɔ abiri ndɛ onkwɛn a nzi me ndɔɔ yi abɛɛl ndɛ m'ekulusu.<verse eid="MRK 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abɛɛl Yeso m'enkulusu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 15:21" />M'obiri b'ekulusu e Yeso, ambwel-bwel asiin ɔ̃mbwel nkuul wu afi ãnguun wɛn nkuũ Simɔ̃, wu mviil li Silɛn. Ndɛ áli tal Alekedzadel ye Lufus. <verse eid="MRK 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 15:22" />Bɔ abiri Yeso ke mboo ngamɔ̃ yi abeta me Ngolongota, ŋ'ayɛɛn ndiri «mboo yi ebiɔ ki ɔ̃tswɛ.» <verse eid="MRK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 15:23" />Bɔ áwi ndɛ mbal ã bvine m'abvool ye miil, kɛn a ndɛ obee onywã. <verse eid="MRK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 15:24" />Bɔ bu abɛɛl ndɛ m'ekulusu, bu akab ekɔ e ndɛ ke mbee a k'eti bɔ bvɛ ebie me ndɔɔ yi ayɛɛ ki ewal mbuul bwɛn a mbuul. <verse eid="MRK 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 15:25" />Ŋ'ebɛɛl bɔ ndɛ m'ekulusu, al'eyii lio li bva li epal-epal. <verse eid="MRK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 15:26" />Éli ye muaan ebɛɛ li ákel ãmpiri m'ãkewa otsɛn b'áwi ndɛ etumbu ki epfu. Áswɛn bubu: «Ɔ̃kwɛn a Ayuda.» <verse eid="MRK 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 15:27" />Tsoo-tsoo a Yeso, bɔ hɛ̃ abɛɛl edzuul bviaal m'enkulusu, kyɛn me nkuɔɔl e ndɛ ki ekal, kyɛn me ki elam. <verse eid="MRK 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 15:28" />[Oŋɔ̃ ŋ'asi m'akel onse Ɔ̃kaan a Nziã ndiri: «Alɔ ndɛ onse ɔ̃bvɛn a baal b'abi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ndɔɔ yi, k'ákel yɔ onse ɛ̃nkaan mikyɛ mi tsɔɔn-tsɔɔn wɛ.</char></note>.»] <verse eid="MRK 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 15:29" />Ɛ̃mbwel-nkuul ɛ̃ketoo Yeso, ɛ̃́kenyiĩ ɛ̃tswɛ bvool ɛ̃́keyɛɛn bubu: «Ee! Yɛ wu ákedzii k'atsal Nzɔ a Nziã bvool atuu yɔ m'ãtsoo ã tyel, <verse eid="MRK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 15:30" />mebvuul nzuru a yɛ yam, mesool nkal ekulusu!» <verse eid="MRK 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 15:31" />Emfa ngemɔ̃ hɛ̃, amfam b'anga-a-Nziã y'ayiool b'ãngel akesɔɔl Yeso bvool ákeyɛɛn bam-a-bam ndiri: «Ndɛ wu ákebvuul bakyɛ, kɛn a ndɛ k'amekoo k'abvuul nzuru a ndyam wɛ! <verse eid="MRK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 15:32" />Meba ŋã, yɔɔl kwɛn Mãsia wu ɔ̃kwɛn a Isalayel amesool nkal ekulusu! Ŋɛn bee emwɛn ndɔɔ oyɔ, oŋɔ̃ bee bu ekiool ndɛ.» Baal b'ábɛɛl m'enkulusu too-tsoo a Yeso áketoo ndɛ hɛ̃.<verse eid="MRK 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Epfu e Yeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 15:33" />Ŋ'eyii tal dzu, empeel ebvi m'ɔ̃kiri a nsie wueel tiil lio li ãtyel ŋ'emeebɔɔn lɔ. <verse eid="MRK 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 15:34" />Ŋ'eyii lio li ãtyel ŋ'emeebɔɔn tal, Yeso obiool me nkii yam yi kokɔ ndiri: «Eli, Eli, lema sabakatani!» Ŋ'ayɛɛn ndiri: «Nziã a mɛ̃, Nziã a mɛ̃, otsɛn omã b'eyiri yɛ mɛ̃?» <verse eid="MRK 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 15:35" />Ŋ'eyoo baal ke kwɛ onse b'áli oŋɔ̃ ãyɛɛn omɔ̃, bɔ abvi oyɛɛn ndiri: «Eyoo, ndɛ ata Eli mbel!» <verse eid="MRK 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 15:36" />Ngɔmɔ̃ onse bɔ osi ntiin, oyewal mpɛɛl a epɔ̃dze, obueel kyɛ me mbal ã ŋɛɛ̃, ndɛ okuru kyɛ me nswɛɛ a ɔ̃mbɛɛl bu awi Yeso mɔ̃ me ndɔɔ yi anywã y'ãyɛɛn m'ɔ̃nywã ndiri: «Emeekiaal, bia-byɛ etal okɛɛn Eli oyekuul ndɛ nkal enkulusu!» <verse eid="MRK 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 15:37" />Kɛn a Yeso obiool me nkii yam yi kokɔ, bu atsuul mwiĩ. <verse eid="MRK 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 15:38" />Obobɔ, ekɔ ki áliɔɔl onse Nzɔ a Nziã ebɔɔl ebaal mviaal, fa ywel tiil nsie. <verse eid="MRK 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 15:39" />Ŋ'emwɛn mfam a ambwel-mbwel ɔ̃nkam wa Lom emfa ki ekwi ndɛ, ndɛ olieel bubu: «Ngwanyã, mbuul wu áli Muaan a Nziã!» <verse eid="MRK 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 15:40" />Akaal ke kwɛ b'áli oŋɔ̃, bɔ hɛ̃ aketal lala. Onse bɔ, éli ye Mali wu ola bo Magadala, ye Mali wu ngoo a Dzak wu mvɔɔl bwɛn a Dzose ye Salome. <verse eid="MRK 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 15:41" />Bɔ b'ákenɔɔn a Yeso bvool ákesal me ndɔɔ a ndɛ ŋ'éli ndɛ ke Ngalile. Oŋɔ̃ éli hɛ̃ y'akaal akyam bibi b'ayɛn Yelusalem ye ndɛ.<verse eid="MRK 15:41" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Adziool ebiĩ e Yeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 15:42" />Éli tsoo li abewal ɔ̃yɛɛl wa saba, m'ãnkunkwal mɛn ela esiool saba, <verse eid="MRK 15:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 15:43" />Dzedzef wa bviil li Alimate oyi. Ndɛ áli ngɔmɔ̃ wu ekewa baal bvɛɛ onse nkel aku-kuul ba mbal yi nɛn yi Ayuda. Ndɛ hɛ̃ ákekiaal oya b'Okwɛn o Nziã. Y'ãŋã mbueel, ndɛ oyetal Pilate, bu osɔɔ ebiĩ e Yeso ola ndɛ. <verse eid="MRK 15:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 15:44" />Pilate okam ŋ'eyoo ndɛ ndiri Yeso amaakwa. Ndɛ oti mbiri a mbwel-mbwel ɔ̃nkam mbel, bu afuul ndɛ okɛɛn etel ki ekwi ndɛ emeeyiil. <verse eid="MRK 15:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 15:45" />Ke mbee ɔ̃mveel a mbiri ambwel-mbwel ɔ̃nkam, Pilate owi Dzedzef nkuul yi awal ebiĩ. <verse eid="MRK 15:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 15:46" />Dzedzef osuun fool, okuul ebiĩ nkal enkulusu, odzii kyɛ onse fool ondɛ, bu ayelɔ kyɛ onse mpiɛɛn yi atsam onse nkɔɔn. Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, ndɛ okeel nkɔɔn yi nɛn k'ɔ̃nywã a mpiɛɛn. <verse eid="MRK 15:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 15:47" />Mali wu ola bo Magadala ye Mali wu ngoo a Dzose áketal mboo yi alɔ ebiĩ e Yeso.<verse eid="MRK 15:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MRK 16" />
  <para style="s1">Osiool o Yeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 16:1" />Ŋ'ebwel tsoo li saba, Mali wu ola bo Magadala, ye Mali wu ngoo a Dzak, ye Salome asuun mbaal m'ãnãsi me ndɔɔ yi ayepwɛɛ m'ebiĩ e Yeso. <verse eid="MRK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 16:2" />Me tsoo li eyenge m'epal-epal kwɔɔl, ŋ'eyii epal tal, bɔ ayɛn mpiɛɛn. <verse eid="MRK 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 16:3" />Bɔ ákeyɛɛn bam-a-bam ndiri: «Wu àkeel bia-byɛ nkɔɔn yi k'ɔ̃nywa a mpiɛɛn nã?» <verse eid="MRK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 16:4" />Kɛn a ŋ'eseel bɔ mviil, bɔ amwɛn kwɛn nkɔɔn ámaakeel. Kwɛn ŋɛn nkɔɔn oyɔ éli yam yi nɛn. <verse eid="MRK 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 16:5" />Ŋ'esam bɔ, bɔ amwɛn nsam a bɔɔl me nsɛn me kuɔɔl ki elam onse mpiɛɛn, ndɛ alaal ekɔ ki fuu. Bɔ ebangɛɛ ebɔɔ. <verse eid="MRK 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 16:6" />Kɛn a ndɛ olieel bɔ bubu: «Ebee ye buɔ oyoo: byɛ ebii Yeso wa Nadzalet wu abɛɛl m'enkulusu, ndɛ amaasiool, ndɛ k'ali ŋã wɛ. Etal mboo yi asuul ndɛ. <verse eid="MRK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 16:7" />Meba ŋã, eyeyɛɛn ayio a ndɛ ye Piɛɛl ndiri: “Ndɛ otsɔɔn nkwel a byɛ ke Ngalile, okɔ ku emwɛn byɛ ndɛ onge b'élieel ndɛ byɛ.”» <verse eid="MRK 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 16:8" />Bɔ apal onse mpiɛɛn, bu abal y'etiɔɔl ye buɔ bueel. Bɔ k'alieel mbuul ndɔɔ wɛ, me ndɔɔ yɛn bɔ ebangɛɛ ébɔɔ.<verse eid="MRK 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso osuo nzuru ola Mali wa Magadala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 16:9" />[ Ke mbee a ŋ'esiool Yeso m'epfu, m'epal e pal ki tsoo li eyenge, ndɛ opal ŋ'ɛ̃kwel ola Maali wa Magadala wu étswɛɛl ndɛ ɛ̃fel mi ɛ̃bi-ebi nsiaan. <verse eid="MRK 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 16:10" />Ɔ̃kaal ondɛ oyeliaal nsia oyɔ ola b'áli ye ndɛ. Ŋ'esa oŋɔ̃, bɔ áli onse ãwuã bvool ákelel. <verse eid="MRK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 16:11" />Kɛn a ŋ'eyoo bɔ Mali ayɛɛn ndiri: «Yeso oli m'omwiĩ, mɛ̃ mwɛn ndɛ!» Bɔ k'akiool ndɛ wɛ.<verse eid="MRK 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso opal ola ayio buaal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 16:12" />Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, Yeso opal m'emfa ekyam ol'ayio buaal b'ákeyi ola. <verse eid="MRK 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 16:13" />Ayio ange-buaal akɔɔl Yelusalem bvool alieel bakyɛ nsia oyɔ, kɛn a bɔ hɛ̃ abee k'akiool bɔ.<verse eid="MRK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso osuo nzuru ol'ayio ange-kuun y'ɔ̃mɔ̃</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 16:14" />Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, Yeso opal ola ayio kuun y'ɔ̃mɔ̃ me lio li ekedza bɔ. Ndɛ oyiaan bɔ me ndɔɔ yɛn bɔ aywɛn a okiool, bvool áli y'ɔ̃kwal mpɛn, ke ngwel wɛ bɔ áti baal b'ámwɛn ndɛ m'omwiĩ ɛ̃nkyam. <verse eid="MRK 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 16:15" />Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, ndɛ olieel bɔ bubu: «Eyi m'ɔ̃kiri a nsie ndyam wueel, etsal Nsia yi Ngesɛ ola baal bueel. <verse eid="MRK 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 16:16" />Mbuul wu àkiool bvool àwal opongo, àkieel abvuul. Kɛn a wɛn k'àkiool wɛ akieel abɔɔ etumbu. <verse eid="MRK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 16:17" />Etal eliĩ bvi eyɛɛ byɛ baal b'àkiool: Bɔ àtswɛɛl ɛ̃fel mi ɛ̃bi-ɛ̃bi me nkuũ a mɛ̃, bɔ àyɛɛn ɛ̃nywã mi alili. <verse eid="MRK 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 16:18" />Bɔ àsiin antaal. Okɛɛn bɔ anywiĩ ɔ̃twɔɔ wu abebam baal ndyam ke wɛn, ndɛ k'àsa bɔ eluɔ wɛ, bɔ àndɔɔl anga-ãluu mviɔɔl, bvool anga-ãluu àbvuul.»<verse eid="MRK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso okɔɔl ola Nziã</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 16:19" />Ke mbee a ŋ'elieel Mfam Yeso bɔ ãndɔɔ omɔ̃, andɛɛl ndɛ oyɛn ywel, bu bvi nsɛn me kuɔɔl e Nziã ki elam. <verse eid="MRK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 16:20" />Ayio ayɛn me ndɔɔ yi ayetsal Nsia yi Ngesɛ ãmboo mbueel. Mfam ákewuaal a bɔ onse ɔ̃sal ondɛ, áketsweel otaa-taa b'ãtee ã bɔ m'emvieel bvi ékemɔɔn m'ãtee omɔ̃<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16.20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bɛɛn ɔ̃luo wu bva tiil wu ãku-mbuaal, ãndɔɔ omɔ̃ k'ákel mɔ̃ onse ɛ̃nkaan mikyɛ mi nsɔɔn-nsɔɔn wɛ.</char></note>.]<verse eid="MRK 16:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 16" />
</usx>